{"ts":"2026-09-26T15:01:29.079Z","session":"acfb2b14-97e1-47c7-9b97-8b6f6c60576e","event":"tool.end","callId":"a44c5d90-5485-4022-9929-b9d19168998e","name":"webSearch","duration_ms":3002,"result":[{"title":"Ashiss Kumar Dash named Infosys CEO designate, to take charge in April 2027","url":"https://www.peoplematters.in/news/appointments/ashiss-kumar-dash-named-infosys-ceo-designate-to-take-charge-in-april-2027-51021","content":"Infosys has appointed company veteran Ashiss Kumar Dash as its CEO-designate, setting the stage for a planned leadership transition as the IT services major sharpens its focus on AI-led growth.\n\n  \n\nAccording to media reports, the board approved Dash's appointment on the recommendation of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee. He will serve as CEO-designate until 31 March 2027 and take over as Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director on 1 April 2027, subject to statutory approvals. [...] ### Appointments\n\n# Ashiss Kumar Dash named Infosys CEO designate, to take charge in April 2027\n\n\n\nRia Duneja•Join UsGoogle News\n\nLinkedIn|\n\nJoin UsGoogle News\n\nArticle cover image\n\nDash will succeed Salil Parekh, who will step down after completing his second five-year term. Parekh will remain CEO until 31 March 2027 to ensure a smooth handover. [...] Infosys Chairman Nandan Nilekani said Dash was well placed to lead the company through the industry's next phase.\n\n  \n\n\"The Board is delighted to appoint Dash as CEO-designate. Our industry is entering a period of considerable change. The Board was clear that our next CEO needed to combine the ability to drive bold transformation with the judgment to preserve the values and customer trust that have always distinguished Infosys,” he said.","score":0.8939131},{"title":"Infosys Appoints Salil S. Parekh as CEO and Managing ...","url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/infosys-appoints-salil-s-parekh-as-ceo-and-managing-director-661468303.html","content":"Infosys announced today that its Board of Directors has appointed Salil S. Parekh as Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director (CEO & MD) of the Company effective January 2, 2018.\n\n     (Logo:  ) [...] Mr. U B Pravin Rao will step down as the interim CEO and Managing Director effective January 2, 2018 and will continue as Chief Operating Officer and a whole-time Director of the Company.\n\nAbout Infosys [...] Accessibility Statement Skip Navigation\n\n# Infosys Appoints Salil S. Parekh as CEO and Managing Director\n\n- India - English\n\nInfosys Logo (PRNewsfoto/Infosys)\")\n\n## News provided by\n\n Infosys \n\nDec 02, 2017, 05:45 ET\n\n## Share this article\n\nShare toX\n\nShare this article\n\nShare toX\n\nBANGALORE, India, December 2, 2017 /PRNewswire/ --","score":0.8846886},{"title":"[Solved]  Who is appointed as the CEO of Infosys in place of Vis","url":"https://testbook.com/question-answer/who-is-appointed-as-the-ceo-of-infosys-in-pl--5f61b12098b643c504e19a37","content":"The correct answer is Salil Parekh.\n\n Salil Parekh was appointed as the CEO & MD of Infosys in place of Vishal Sikka on 2nd January 2018.\n Prior to this, he was a member of the Group Executive Board at Capgemini.\n\nImportant Points [...] | N.R. Narayanmurthi |  He is the founder of Infosys.  He has been awarded Padma Shri (2000) and Padma Vibhushan (2008) by Government of India. | [...] | Nandan Nilekani |  He was the co-founder and co-chairman of Infosys  He was also the chairman of the Unique Identification Authority of India (UIDAI) in the rank of a Cabinet Minister.  He was awarded Padma Bhusan in 2006.  He is also the author of “Imagining India” and co- authored his second book with Viral Shah, “Rebooting India: Realizing a Billion Aspirations”. |","score":0.8812988},{"title":"Infosys Board Appoints Ashiss Kumar Dash as CEO ...","url":"https://www.infosys.com/newsroom/press-releases/2026/board-appoints-ceo-designate.html","content":"Infosys (NSE, BSE, NYSE: INFY), a global leader in AI-first business consulting and technology services, today announced the appointment of Ashiss Kumar Dash as CEO Designate. This appointment is based on the recommendation of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee of the Infosys Board, and is for a period of five years, subject to the approval of shareholders. [...] Playback Speed\n\n# Infosys Board Appoints Ashiss Kumar Dash as CEO Designate\n\nLeadership transition to be effective April 1, 2027\n\nBengaluru, India – July 23, 2026 [...] Dash is currently the global head of a diverse business portfolio comprising multiple industry verticals and is planned to succeed Salil Parekh as Managing Director & Chief Executive Officer on April 1, 2027, following the completion of Salil’s second term, after over 9 years.","score":0.85008353},{"title":"Salil Parekh: Infosys appoints Capgemini’s Salil Parekh as MD & CEO - Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/infosys-appoints-capgeminis-salil-parekh-as-md-ceo/articleshow/61893756.cms","content":"BENGALURU: Infosys has appointed Salil Parekh chief executive officer (CEO) and managing director (MD) of the company with effect from January 2 next year, culminating the search of a CEO which began since the departure of Vishal Sikka in August due to a spat with the founders over various issues. [...] Infosys appoints Capgemini’s Salil Parekh as MD and CEO\n\nInfosys' newly appointed MD & CEO Salil Parekh (Image Source: Twitter)\n\nKey Highlights\n\n Infosys has appointed Salil Parekh MD & CEO of the company with effect from January 2\n He joins from French IT and consulting company Capgemini where he is the CEO of financial services across Europe\n Infosys will hope that Parekh’s background in financial services gets them to garner more deals [...] The appointment marks the end of the intense CEO search Infosys embarked in August, after a protracted public spat with the company’s founding executives, led by Narayana Murthy led to Sikka’s resignation, over alleged corporate governance lapses.","score":0.84858394}]}
