{"ts":"2026-09-26T15:35:05.955Z","session":"c47cae16-279d-41a2-b401-3efa2780e299","event":"tool.end","callId":"83ff8c21-0fb3-4e5c-853b-c2f82767ac41","name":"webSearch","duration_ms":2982,"result":[{"title":"SWIGGY INSTAMART PRIVATE LIMITED - 2026 Company Profile - Tracxn","url":"https://tracxn.com/d/legal-entities/india/swiggy-instamart-private-limited/__TKi-aQjuXlJ-YRC_0v-3fDvLnK5_Fd2sbYR49LNH1As","content":"SWIGGY INSTAMART PRIVATE LIMITED is a Private Limited Company and was incorporated on Sep 12, 2025 in India. It is registered at Registrar of Companies, ROC Bangalore. Its registered address is No.55 Sy No.8-14, GF, I&J Block, Embassy Tech, Bellandur, Bangalore, Bangalore South, Karnataka, India, 560103.  Its corporate identification number is (CIN) U47912KA2025PTC208374 and its current status is Active. Its industry classification as per MCA is retail sale via e-commerce. [...] JavaScript is disabled in your browser. enable it to enjoy the full features of Tracxn.\n\nTracxn.com\nAndroid\nApple\nChrome Web Store\nFirefox Extension\ntracxn ai suite\n\nAI-powered market intelligence across companies, investors, and sectors.\n\n# SWIGGY INSTAMART PRIVATE LIMITED - Company Profile\n\n## About SWIGGY INSTAMART PRIVATE LIMITED [...] SWIGGY INSTAMART PRIVATE LIMITED's authorised share capital is ₹10L and its paid up capital is ₹1L. The current board of directors of SWIGGY INSTAMART PRIVATE LIMITED comprises Sri Harsha Majety and Nandan Reddy.\n\n## Contact Details for SWIGGY INSTAMART PRIVATE LIMITED\n\n## Documents of SWIGGY INSTAMART PRIVATE LIMITED15 mins\n\n### Recent Filings\n\nBelow are the most recent filings submitted by the company:","score":0.8306082},{"title":"Swiggy - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swiggy","content":"Increase\nDecrease\nDecrease\n\nSwiggy Limited is an Indian online food ordering and delivery company, headquartered in Bengaluru. As of 2025( it operates food delivery services in more than 700 Indian cities, and quick-commerce services under the name Instamart in 100 cities. The company was incorporated in 2013.\n\nSwiggy competes primarily with Zomato in food delivery. In quick-commerce, Instamart ranks behind competitors Blinkit and Zepto \"Zepto (company)\") in terms of market share.\n\n## History [...] In May 2020, Swiggy laid off 1,100 employees during the pandemic. The pandemic also resulted in the shut down of more than three-fourths of its cloud kitchens.\n\nIn August 2020, Swiggy launched its instant grocery delivery service called Instamart using a network of dark stores. In early 2021, the company closed Swiggy Stores and expanded its operations under Instamart. [...] In July 2025, Swiggy expanded its quick-commerce business Instamart to 127 cities across India and added 41 new dark stores.\n\n## References\n\n## External links\n\nEdit this at Wikidata","score":0.7933146},{"title":"Swiggy Instamart Business Model & Revenue Strategy","url":"https://www.icoderzsolutions.com/blog/instamart-business-model","content":"Swiggy Instamart is Swiggy’s quick commerce arm that delivers groceries, fresh produce, snacks, and household essentials through a fast, hyperlocal delivery network. You can explore the live platform at Swiggy Instamart. [...] Quick commerce has changed how India shops for groceries, and the Instamart business model sits right at the center of that shift. Swiggy launched Instamart to deliver everyday essentials quickly through a hyperlocal network, and it now competes directly with Blinkit and Zepto for a share of India’s fast-growing quick commerce market. [...] How Instamart has evolved: Instamart started as a grocery add-on within the Swiggy app and grew into a standalone quick commerce business with its own dark store network and app experience.\n Instamart’s role in Swiggy’s ecosystem: It complements Swiggy’s food delivery business, cross-selling to the same customer base while tapping into a new use case — quick, everyday grocery needs.\n\n## How Does the Instamart Business Model Work?","score":0.70871735},{"title":"Instamart - 2026 Company Profile, Funding & Competitors - Tracxn","url":"https://tracxn.com/d/companies/instamart/__D5g1hntOjcAEcbfGgaSCI9-DycJiBD7Z01qDiHLq2hc","content":"Instamart is a funded company. Instamart has 1 institutional investor.\n\n## Instamart's founders and board of directors\n\n### Instamart's employee count trend\n\nEmployee count trend for Instamart\nlock\nchrome_extension_cta_illustration\n\n## Instamart's Competitors and alternates [...] | 18th | Logo for Instamart  Instamart 2005, Denver  (United States), Funding Raised | Online retailer offering ultra-fast grocery delivery  TGV | 48/100 | [...] JavaScript is disabled in your browser. enable it to enjoy the full features of Tracxn.\n\nTracxn.com\nAndroid\nApple\nChrome Web Store\nFirefox Extension\ntracxn ai suite\n\nAI-powered market intelligence across companies, investors, and sectors.\n\nLogo for Instamart\n\n# Instamart - Company Profile\n\nlock\nlock\nlock\nlock\nlock\n\n## Instamart - About the company\n\n### Company Details\n\nX\nFacebook\nPDF Illustration Image\n\n## Instamart's funding and investors","score":0.6708892},{"title":"Instamart","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/swiggy-instamart","content":"### Website\n\n### Crunchbase\nN/A\n### LinkedIn\nN/A\n\n### Industry\nTechnology, Information and Internet\n\n### Company Size\n1,001-5,000 employees  \n5419 associated members (LinkedIn members who've listed Instamart as their current workplace on their profile)\n\n### Founded\nN/A\n\n### Funding\nLast Round Date: N/A\nLast Round Type: N/A\nTotal Rounds: N/A\nLast Round Raised: N/A\n\n### Investors\nN/A\n\n### Specialties\nN/A\n\n## Locations\nBengaluru, Karnataka, IN\n\n### Get Directions\nDirections","score":0.59401023}]}
