rs\n\nImage 5: Zepto\n\n# Zepto Email Format\n\nGet Verified Emails for 20,200 Zepto Employees\n\n5 free lookups. No credit card required.\n\n[S17] Zepto: Fast Grocery Delivery via AI and Dark Stores | AMPulse Daily posted on the topic | LinkedIn\nURL: https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ampulse-daily_innovation-ai-startups-activity-7384174677750923265-q8d6\n10. Today, Zepto clocks over 17 lakh orders daily in 80 cities with over 1000 dark stores. Nearly 20% of its orders come from smaller towns, and it is valued at over 60,000 CR today. 💰\n  ➡️Who would have thought that a 19 year old dropout boy would create one of the largest companies giving a tough fit to Zomato and Swiggy? 🙏\n  #startups #india [...] ⸻\n  8️⃣ In May 2022, Zepto raised ₹1,530 crore at a valuation of ₹5,350 crore.\n  Approaching unicorn status, it scaled to 300,000 daily orders and crossed ₹3,000 crore in annual sales.\n  ⸻\n  9️⃣ Then came the defining moment — Zepto raised ₹1,650 crore led by StepStone Group, reaching a valuation of ₹11,600 crore.\n  It became India’s first quick-commerce unicorn of 2023.\n  ⸻\n  🔟 Today, Zepto processes more than 17 lakh orders daily across 80 cities, supported by 1,000+ dark stores. [...] Blinkit and Zepto are the faces, but the real innovation is happening in the shadows in the companies building the tech, time, and trust that power speed.\n  #blinkit #quickcommerce #ecosystem #zepto #instamart #swiggy #zomato\n\n[S18] Blinkit - Wikipedia\nURL: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blinkit\nBlinkit is an Indian quick-commerce company owned by Eternal Limited. It was founded in December 2013 and is based in Gurgaon.\n\nCustomers of the company use a mobile app to order groceries and essentials online, which are sourced from the company's dark stores and delivered in 10 minutes. Blinkit operates in 153 cities in India, as of March 2025.\n\nIn 2022, Zomato Limited (now Eternal) acquired Blinkit for US$568 million in an all-stock deal.\n\n## History\n\n[edit] [...] Blinkit\n\n| Formerly | Grofers (2013–2021) |\n| Type | Subsidiary |\n| Industry | Q-commerce |\n| Founded | December 2013; 12 years ago (2013-12) |\n| Founders | Albinder Dhindsa Saurabh Kumar |\n| Headquarters | Gurgaon, Haryana, India |\n| Area served | India |\n| Key people | Albinder Dhindsa (CEO) |\n| Products | Bistro |\n| Services | Online grocer |\n| Revenue | Increase ₹5,206 crore (US$540 million) (FY25) |\n| Parent | Eternal Limited |\n| Website | blinkit.com | [...] In June 2022, a Bengaluru-based web development company called Blinkhit filed a trademark infringement lawsuit against Blinkit.\n\nIn April 2023, hundreds of Blinkit delivery partners in Delhi NCR, where about half of the company's dark stores were located, went on strike after a revision in payout structure resulted in lower earnings for them. This led to a temporary closure of many dark stores.\n\n[S19] Blinkit Foods Limited - 2026 Company Profile - Tracxn\nURL: https://tracxn.com/d/legal-entities/india/blinkit-foods-limited/__djKNSolKqqiifOhCQSY8wrP4ba7ttguUwe7MUea3s2U\nBlinkit Foods Limited is a Public Limited Company and was incorporated on Aug 18, 2025 in India. It is registered at Registrar of Companies, ROC Delhi I. Its registered address is T-19, Basement, Green Park Main, Green Park, South West Delhi, New Delhi, Delhi, India, 110016.  Its corporate identification number is (CIN) U47222DL2025PLC453320 and its current status is Active. Its industry classification as per MCA is retail sale of non-alcoholic beverages including icecream not for consumption [...] | Name | Short Description | Founded Year | Location | Current Stage |\n ---  --- \n| Logo for Blinkit Blinkit | Online retailer of groceries, personal care, and household essential products | 2013 | India | Acquired |\n\nLogo for Blinkit\n\n## Documents of Blinkit Foods Limited15 mins\n\n### Latest Financials, Share Allotment and Annual Report\n\nThe latest filed financial documents, annual reports, and share allotment filings are shown below:\n\n### Recent Filings [...] Blinkit Foods Limited's authorised share capital is ₹1Cr and its paid up capital is ₹27.5L. The current board of directors of Blinkit Foods Limited comprises Deepak Ahluwalia, Ali Kausar Siddiqui and 1 more.\n\n## Contact Details for Blinkit Foods Limited\n\n## Brands associated with Blinkit Foods Limited\n\n[S20] Blinkit\nURL: https://www.zoominfo.com/c/blinkit/359515698\n# Blinkit\n\nBlink Commerce Private Limited, d/b/a Blinkit and formerly Grofers, is an Indian instant delivery service. Customers of the company use a mobile application to order groceries and essentials online. Blinkit's employees then secure the items from their warehouse and deliver the items to the consumer within 10 minutes. In 2022, Zomato acquired Blinki... \n\n## Leadership [...] ## Leadership\n\n- Khevender Daga — Quick Commerce Finance Controller (Blinkit & ...\n- Sanchit Bhasin — City Chief Executive Officer - Gujarat\n- Simran Shrivastav — Co-Chief Executive Officer\n\n## Company Details\n\n- Website: \n- Revenue: $94.2 Million\n- Employees: 1K - 5K\n- Industries: Freight & Logistics Services; Retail; Transportation; Grocery Retail\n- Headquarters: Golf Course Road Vipul Tech Sector-43 Sq Fl 4, Gurgaon, Haryana, 122001, India\n\n## Social Media\n\n- \n- \n- \n\n## Tech Stack [...] - blinkit cfo vipin kapooria has exited the quick commerce startup after more than a year moneycontrol reported kapooria could likely rejoin flipkart where he had worked for around seven years in two separate stints he was blinkits first fulltime designated cfo since amit sachdeva who worked at the startup as cfo between 2019 and 2022 left the firm\n- Blinkit-AI, an advanced artificial intelligence-driven platform, has raised $1.2 million in its seed funding round from Foliflex Cables (India).\n\n[S21] Blinkit - India's Last Minute App ✨ Sell your products on Blinkit via seller.blinkit.com\nURL: https://in.linkedin.com/company/letsblinkit\n## Overview\nBlinkit (An Eternal Company) is a grocery and e-commerce platform. We pioneered the doorstep delivery model in India with over 10 million Indians shopping on Blinkit, for everything from grocery staples and vegetables to emergency supplies and electronics, and much more. If our mission interests you, send your CV to future@blinkit.com\n\n### Website\n\n### Crunchbase\nN/A\n### LinkedIn\nN/A\n\n### Industry\nTechnology, Information and Internet [...] ### Company Size\n1,001-5,000 employees  \n29232 associated members (LinkedIn members who've listed Blinkit as their current workplace on their profile)\n\n### Founded\n2013\n\n### Funding\nLast Round Date: N/A\nLast Round Type: N/A\nTotal Rounds: N/A\nLast Round Raised: N/A\n\n### Investors\nN/A\n\n### Specialties\nN/A\n\n## Locations\nPioneer Square, Sector 62, Golf Course Extension, Blinkit Headquarters, Gurgaon, Haryana 122001, IN\n\n### Get Directions\nDirections [...] ## Similar Companies\n\n[S22] Blinkit | Eternal\nURL: https://eternal.com/our-businesses/blinkit\nEternal\n\nInstant commerce indistinguishable from magic\n\nLaunched with the ambition of making everyday essentials available at your doorstep, Blinkit has revolutionized how India shops.  \n  \nIt has now evolved into a full-fledged quick commerce company, delivering thousands of products including grocery and daily essentials, electronics, beauty & personal care items, stationery, and emergency supplies.\n\n# Leading the quick commerce evolution [...] Blinkit is powered by a dynamic network of customers, store partners, and delivery partners working together seamlessly.\n\n31 million+ customers use our app monthly\n\n2,400+ stores across 300+ cities\n\n500,000+ delivery partners delivering at your doorstep\n\n# Beyond essentials\n\nBlinkit is constantly innovating to serve the evolving customer needs, the latest being in:\n\nBeauty & personal care\n\nBeauty & personal care [...] Sports\n\nSports\n\nFor training, playing, or just starting out, you can get the right gear delivered to your doorstep.\n\nToys\n\nToys\n\nBrain-boosting games, cuddly companions, and everything in between — toys to match every age and every mood.\n\n# Download the app now\n\nEverything you need, delivered to your doorstep on the Blinkit app.\n\nApp Download LogoApp Download Logo\n\nScan the QR code to download the app\n\ndownload app\n\n# Our other businesses\n\nBringing the world closer, one meal at a time\n\n[S23] SWIGGY INSTAMART PRIVATE LIMITED - 2026 Company Profile - Tracxn\nURL: https://tracxn.com/d/legal-entities/india/swiggy-instamart-private-limited/__TKi-aQjuXlJ-YRC_0v-3fDvLnK5_Fd2sbYR49LNH1As\nSWIGGY INSTAMART PRIVATE LIMITED is a Private Limited Company and was incorporated on Sep 12, 2025 in India. It is registered at Registrar of Companies, ROC Bangalore. Its registered address is No.55 Sy No.8-14, GF, I&J Block, Embassy Tech, Bellandur, Bangalore, Bangalore South, Karnataka, India, 560103.  Its corporate identification number is (CIN) U47912KA2025PTC208374 and its current status is Active. Its industry classification as per MCA is retail sale via e-commerce. [...] JavaScript is disabled in your browser. enable it to enjoy the full features of Tracxn.\n\nTracxn.com\nAndroid\nApple\nChrome Web Store\nFirefox Extension\ntracxn ai suite\n\nAI-powered market intelligence across companies, investors, and sectors.\n\n# SWIGGY INSTAMART PRIVATE LIMITED - Company Profile\n\n## About SWIGGY INSTAMART PRIVATE LIMITED [...] SWIGGY INSTAMART PRIVATE LIMITED's authorised share capital is ₹10L and its paid up capital is ₹1L. The current board of directors of SWIGGY INSTAMART PRIVATE LIMITED comprises Sri Harsha Majety and Nandan Reddy.\n\n## Contact Details for SWIGGY INSTAMART PRIVATE LIMITED\n\n## Documents of SWIGGY INSTAMART PRIVATE LIMITED15 mins\n\n### Recent Filings\n\nBelow are the most recent filings submitted by the company:\n\n[S24] Swiggy - Wikipedia\nURL: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swiggy\nIncrease\nDecrease\nDecrease\n\nSwiggy Limited is an Indian online food ordering and delivery company, headquartered in Bengaluru. As of 2025( it operates food delivery services in more than 700 Indian cities, and quick-commerce services under the name Instamart in 100 cities. The company was incorporated in 2013.\n\nSwiggy competes primarily with Zomato in food delivery. In quick-commerce, Instamart ranks behind competitors Blinkit and Zepto \"Zepto (company)\") in terms of market share.\n\n## History [...] In May 2020, Swiggy laid off 1,100 employees during the pandemic. The pandemic also resulted in the shut down of more than three-fourths of its cloud kitchens.\n\nIn August 2020, Swiggy launched its instant grocery delivery service called Instamart using a network of dark stores. In early 2021, the company closed Swiggy Stores and expanded its operations under Instamart. [...] In July 2025, Swiggy expanded its quick-commerce business Instamart to 127 cities across India and added 41 new dark stores.\n\n## References\n\n## External links\n\nEdit this at Wikidata\n\n[S25] Swiggy Instamart Business Model & Revenue Strategy\nURL: https://www.icoderzsolutions.com/blog/instamart-business-model\nSwiggy Instamart is Swiggy’s quick commerce arm that delivers groceries, fresh produce, snacks, and household essentials through a fast, hyperlocal delivery network. You can explore the live platform at Swiggy Instamart. [...] Quick commerce has changed how India shops for groceries, and the Instamart business model sits right at the center of that shift. Swiggy launched Instamart to deliver everyday essentials quickly through a hyperlocal network, and it now competes directly with Blinkit and Zepto for a share of India’s fast-growing quick commerce market. [...] How Instamart has evolved: Instamart started as a grocery add-on within the Swiggy app and grew into a standalone quick commerce business with its own dark store network and app experience.\n Instamart’s role in Swiggy’s ecosystem: It complements Swiggy’s food delivery business, cross-selling to the same customer base while tapping into a new use case — quick, everyday grocery needs.\n\n## How Does the Instamart Business Model Work?\n\n[S26] Instamart - 2026 Company Profile, Funding & Competitors - Tracxn\nURL: https://tracxn.com/d/companies/instamart/__D5g1hntOjcAEcbfGgaSCI9-DycJiBD7Z01qDiHLq2hc\nInstamart is a funded company. Instamart has 1 institutional investor.\n\n## Instamart's founders and board of directors\n\n### Instamart's employee count trend\n\nEmployee count trend for Instamart\nlock\nchrome_extension_cta_illustration\n\n## Instamart's Competitors and alternates [...] | 18th | Logo for Instamart  Instamart 2005, Denver  (United States), Funding Raised | Online retailer offering ultra-fast grocery delivery  TGV | 48/100 | [...] JavaScript is disabled in your browser. enable it to enjoy the full features of Tracxn.\n\nTracxn.com\nAndroid\nApple\nChrome Web Store\nFirefox Extension\ntracxn ai suite\n\nAI-powered market intelligence across companies, investors, and sectors.\n\nLogo for Instamart\n\n# Instamart - Company Profile\n\nlock\nlock\nlock\nlock\nlock\n\n## Instamart - About the company\n\n### Company Details\n\nX\nFacebook\nPDF Illustration Image\n\n## Instamart's funding and investors\n\n[S27] Instamart\nURL: https://in.linkedin.com/company/swiggy-instamart\n### Website\n\n### Crunchbase\nN/A\n### LinkedIn\nN/A\n\n### Industry\nTechnology, Information and Internet\n\n### Company Size\n1,001-5,000 employees  \n5419 associated members (LinkedIn members who've listed Instamart as their current workplace on their profile)\n\n### Founded\nN/A\n\n### Funding\nLast Round Date: N/A\nLast Round Type: N/A\nTotal Rounds: N/A\nLast Round Raised: N/A\n\n### Investors\nN/A\n\n### Specialties\nN/A\n\n## Locations\nBengaluru, Karnataka, IN\n\n### Get Directions\nDirections",{"json":true}]}
