ound  at $120 Mn valuation","url":"https://entrackr.com/news/firstclub-raises-23-mn-in-series-a-round-at-120-mn-valuation-9885513","content":"Quick-commerce startup FirstClub has raised $23 million in Series A funding led by Accel and RTP Global with participation from Blume Founders Fund, 2am VC, Paramark Ventures, and Aditya Birla Ventures. \n\nAs per media reports, the round also includes a small debt component.\n\nThis funding has pushed the firm's valuation to $120 million, almost triple its value in December 2024 when it raised $8 million in its seed round from Accel and RTP Global. [...] ## Quick-commerce startup FirstClub has raised $23 million in Series A funding led by Accel and RTP Global with participation from Blume Founders Fund, 2am VC, Paramark Ventures\n\nauthor-image/entrackr/media/member_avatars/2024/10/21/2024-10-21t084255793z-shashank-circle-png-768x768.png )\n\n Follow Us\n\nfirstclub/entrackr/media/media_files/2025/09/04/firstclub-2025-09-04-10-15-30.png)","score":0.86331123},{"title":"Paramark Ventures Portfolio Investments, Paramark Ventures Funds, Paramark Ventures Exits","url":"https://www.cbinsights.com/investor/paramark-ventures","content":"with more investors looking for exposure to quick commerce. A slew of its early backers including Blume Founders Fund, Quiet Capital, and 2am VC and others are also likely to participate in the round on a pro rata basis, sources said. FirstClub is commanding a valuation of around $120-130 million, up sharply from around $50 million in December 2024, as its expands to newer pockets in Bengaluru. FirstClub, Accel, Paramark Ventures and RTP Global did not respond to queries sent by Moneycontrol. [...] | Co-Investors | Accel India, Bertelsmann India Investments, Crescent Enterprises, General Catalyst, Good Capital, Iron Pillar, and Undisclosed Investors | Accel, Peak XV Partners, RTP Global, Sofina, and Undisclosed Investors | 2AM Ventures, Accel, Aditya Birla Ventures, Blume Ventures, and RTP Global | Su