{"ts":"2026-09-26T15:39:26.271Z","session":"13e27e25-8c9f-4fb2-9419-8b36029615ad","event":"tool.end","callId":"ff658ed7-c952-4904-8518-ccb277b96fb3","name":"webSearch","duration_ms":2532,"result":[{"title":"Infosys | Company Overview & News","url":"https://www.forbes.com/companies/infosys","content":"Infosys Ltd. is a digital services and consulting company, which engages in the provision of end-to-end business solutions. It operates through the following segments: Financial Services, Retail, Communication; Energy, Utilities, Resources, and Services; Manufacturing, Hi-Tech, Life Sciences, and All Other. The company was founded by Dinesh Krishnan Swamy, Senapathy Gopalakrishnan, Narayana Ramarao Nagavara Murthy, Raghavan N. S., Ashok Arora, Nandan M. Nilekani, and S. D. Shibulal on July 2, [...] Shibulal on July 2, 1981 and is headquartered in Bangalore, India. [...] The consulting companies recognized on this year's list span 31 countries and offer expertise in a wide range of industries including IT, retail, pharmaceuticals and more.","score":0.9008183},{"title":"Infosys - LinkedIn","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/infosys","content":"Infosys is a global leader in next-generation digital services and consulting. We enable clients in more than 50 countries to navigate their digital transformation. With over three decades of experience in managing the systems and workings of global enterprises, we expertly steer our clients through their digital journey. We do it by enabling the enterprise with an AI-powered core that helps prioritize the execution of change. We also empower the business with agile digital at scale to deliver [...] at scale to deliver unprecedented levels of performance and customer delight. Our always-on learning agenda drives their continuous improvement through building and transferring digital skills, expertise, and ideas from our innovation ecosystem. Visit www.infosys.com to see how Infosys (NYSE: INFY) can help your enterprise navigate your next. [...] # Infosys\nTransforming Enterprises To Become A Thriving Live Enterprise. AI-Powered. Digital Agility At Scale. Always-On Learning.\nIT Services and IT Consulting • Bangalore, Karnataka • 11,408,183 followers • 10,001+ employees","score":0.8286204},{"title":"Infosys","url":"https://www.zoominfo.com/c/infosys-ltd/58804259","content":"# Infosys\n\nInfosys is a global provider of next-generation digital services and consulting services. Infosys provides information technology and digital marketing services such as AI and automation, Agile and DevOps, Salesforce, cyber security, data analytics, engineering services, and much more. Infosys is headquartered in Bengaluru, India.... \n\n## Leadership [...] - [On August 18, Infosys (NYSE:INFY) announced a long-term deal to manage the enterprise software behind Knorr-Bremse AG, a maker of braking systems for rail and commercial vehicles. The work stretches from ERP and data platforms to engineering and product lifecycle tools, and it runs on Infosys Topaz, the company’s AI offering. It is a nice […]](\n- The Palo Alto startup says it has landed multiple seven-figure enterprise contracts within months of launch. [...] ## Leadership\n\n- Kiran Umakanth — Senior Principal - Chief Information Officer ...\n- Vijayanush Narasimh... — Chief Financial Officer, (India & South Asia)\n- Raktim Singh — Chief Technology Officer, Office\n\n## Company Details\n\n- Website: \n- Revenue: $18.8 Billion\n- Stock Symbol:  INFY\n- Employees: 10K+\n- Industries: Business Services; Software Testing\n- Headquarters: 44 Infosys Avenue Hosur Electronics City Rd, Bengaluru, Karnātaka, 560100, India\n- Phone: +91 8028520261\n\n## Social Media\n\n- \n-","score":0.8005209},{"title":"[Infosys India Competitors](/infosys-india-competitors_b7f66710c2adef45 \"Infosys India Competitors\")","url":"https://rocketreach.co/infosys-india-competitors_b7f66710c2adef45","content":"Wipro Limited (NYSE: WIT, BSE: 507685, NSE: WIPRO) is a leading AI-powe