ng-infosys-ceo-on-life-after-infosys-and-nandan-nilekani-13990109.html\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Infosys was founded in 1981 by seven visionary engineers: N.R. Narayana Murthy, Nandan Nilekani, Kris Gopalakrishnan, S.D. Shibulal, K. Dinesh, N.S. Raghavan, and Ashok Arora.\",\n      \"citedUrl\": \"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/history-of-infosys\",\n      \"supportingUrls\": [\n        \"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/history-of-infosys\",\n        \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/N._R._Narayana_Murthy\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"entitiesLearned\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Salil Parekh\",\n      \"type\": \"Person\",\n      \"facts\": [\n        \"Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director of Infosys since January 2, 2018\",\n        \"Graduated with a B.Tech. in Aeronautical Engineering from IIT Bombay in 1986 and an M.S. from Cornell University in 1988\"\n      ],\n      \"sourceUrl\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salil_Parekh\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Infosys\",\n      \"type\": \"Company\",\n      \"facts\": [\n        \"Founded in 1981 by N.R. Narayana Murthy, Nandan Nilekani, Kris Gopalakrishnan, S.D. Shibulal, K. Dinesh, N.S. Raghavan, and Ashok Arora\"\n      ],\n      \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/history-of-infosys\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unableToFind\": []\n}","usage":{"inputTokens":6757,"outputTokens":1036,"totalTokens":7793,"usd":0.004617100000000001,"rupees":0.4063048000000001},"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite"}}
