{"ts":"2026-09-26T15:40:27.777Z","session":"690c1958-498c-4c54-adff-1d9cbab4a284","event":"tool.end","callId":"4f6b266b-f970-4b0e-9d50-601f08dacaf5","name":"webSearch","duration_ms":2536,"result":[{"title":"Infosys Appoints Salil S. Parekh as CEO and Managing ...","url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/infosys-appoints-salil-s-parekh-as-ceo-and-managing-director-661468303.html","content":"Infosys announced today that its Board of Directors has appointed Salil S. Parekh as Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director (CEO & MD) of the Company effective January 2, 2018.\n\n     (Logo:  ) [...] Mr. U B Pravin Rao will step down as the interim CEO and Managing Director effective January 2, 2018 and will continue as Chief Operating Officer and a whole-time Director of the Company.\n\nAbout Infosys [...] Accessibility Statement Skip Navigation\n\n# Infosys Appoints Salil S. Parekh as CEO and Managing Director\n\n- India - English\n\nInfosys Logo (PRNewsfoto/Infosys)\")\n\n## News provided by\n\n Infosys \n\nDec 02, 2017, 05:45 ET\n\n## Share this article\n\nShare toX\n\nShare this article\n\nShare toX\n\nBANGALORE, India, December 2, 2017 /PRNewswire/ --","score":0.90869105},{"title":"Infosys appoints Capgemini's Salil Parekh as MD & CEO","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/infosys-appoints-capgeminis-salil-parekh-as-md-ceo/articleshow/61893756.cms","content":"BENGALURU: Infosys has appointed Salil Parekh chief executive officer (CEO) and managing director (MD) of the company with effect from January 2 next year, culminating the search of a CEO which began since the departure of Vishal Sikka in August due to a spat with the founders over various issues. [...] Infosys appoints Capgemini’s Salil Parekh as MD and CEO\n\nInfosys' newly appointed MD & CEO Salil Parekh (Image Source: Twitter)\n\nKey Highlights\n\n Infosys has appointed Salil Parekh MD & CEO of the company with effect from January 2\n He joins from French IT and consulting company Capgemini where he is the CEO of financial services across Europe\n Infosys will hope that Parekh’s background in financial services gets them to garner more deals [...] As part of the appointment, interim CEO and MD Pravin Rao, a company veteran, will step down from his role but continue as the chief operating officer and a whole time director till August 2022 “The board is also grateful to Pravin for his leadership during this period of transition,” Nilekani added.","score":0.89053273},{"title":"Salil Parekh","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salil_Parekh","content":"Salil Parekh (born 5 June 1964) is the current chief executive officer and managing director of Infosys. Parekh took over from interim CEO U. B. Pravin Rao on 2 January 2018 for a five year term. The Infosys board has announced that Ashiss Kumar Dash will succeed him as CEO in April 2027.\n\nParekh is a member of The Business Council.\n\n## Early life and education\n\n[edit] [...] Parekh was member of the group executive board, and was appointed deputy CEO in March 2015. He was responsible for overseeing a business cluster comprising Application Services and Cloud Infrastructure Services among others. He then ascended as CEO of MD of Infosys in 2018. Under his leadership Infosys underwent a major digital transformation that increased their company's revenue by 35%.\n\n## Whistleblower allegations\n\n[edit] [...] 4. ↑ \"A Gujarati appointed as CEO and MD of Infosys\". DeshGujarat. 2 December 2017. Retrieved 14 July 2025.\n5. ↑ D'Monte, Leslie (31 March 2015). \"Capgemini names Salil Parekh deputy CEO\". mint. Retrieved 20 April 2021.\n6. ↑ Shivapriya, N. \"Salil Parekh: The man who played a pivotal role in building Capgemini's India operations\". The Economic Times. Retrieved 20 April 2021.\n7. ↑ D'Monte, Leslie (31 March 2015). \"Capgemini names Salil Parekh deputy CEO\". LiveMint. Retrieved 3 January 2018.","score":0.8900749},{"title":"Infosys Names Ashiss Kumar Dash CEO-Designate as ...","url":"https://indianewengland.com/infosys-names-ashiss-kumar-dash-ceo-designate-as-salil-parekh-prepares-to-step-down","content":"INDIA New England News\n\n Search for\n\nBusiness\n\n# Infosys Names Ashiss Kumar Dash CEO-Designate as Salil Parekh Prepares to Step Down\n\nJuly 23, 2026\n\n1,138  1 minute read\n\nFacebook   X   LinkedIn   Tumblr   Pinterest   Reddit   VKontakte   Odnoklassniki   Pocket\n\n\n\nBengaluru–Infosys announced Thursday that CEO and Managing Director Salil Parekh will step down after nine years at the helm, with Ashiss Kumar Dash appointed as his successor. [...] Parekh will leave the role effective April 1, 2027, following the completion of his second term. He joined Infosys in January 2018 and is the longest-serving non-founder CEO in the company’s history.\n\nDash will become CEO and Managing Director on April 1, 2027, subject to the completion of statutory requirements, Infosys said in a regulatory filing. [...] Nilekani also praised Parekh for strengthening Infosys during his tenure.\n\n“On behalf of the Board, I also thank Salil for his outstanding leadership over 9 years. Under his stewardship, Infosys has strengthened its market position, expanded its capabilities, delivered significant value to shareholders, and built a strong platform for future growth,” he said.\n\nParekh’s current five-year term is scheduled to end March 31, 2027, allowing Dash to take over the following day. (Source: IANS)","score":0.8215175},{"title":"Infosys CEO, Salil Parekh, Joins AdvanceCT's Board of ...","url":"https://www.advancect.org/news-and-media/p/item/57410/infosys-ceo-salil-parekh-joins-advancects-board-of-directors","content":"Home\n\nLatest News.png)\n\n# Infosys CEO, Salil Parekh, Joins AdvanceCT's Board of Directors\n\n8 May 2024\n\n  \n\nPress Release, News\n\nNew Haven, Connecticut, May 8, 2024 – Today, AdvanceCT announced that Salil Parekh, the Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director of Infosys, will be joining our Board of Directors