ta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/round-logo-70x70.avif)\n\nData and Statistics\n\n![Factodata logo](https://factodata.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/round-logo-70x70.avif)\n\nData and Statistics\n\n# TATA Group Chairmen: 1868 to 2025\n\n![](https://factodata.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/TATA-chairman-timline-1-png.webp)\n\n[TATA Group](https://factodata.com/tata-group-of-companies-innovation-business-growth/) Chairmen is the the Chairmen of the board of TATA sons. It was **founded in 1868** by **Sir Jamshedji TATA** with a cotton mill. later on it became [India](https://factodata.com/india/india-overview/)‘s [largest conglomerate](https://factodata.com/top-indian-companies-by-market-capitalization-in-2025/) with total of 30 companies.\n\nThe [TATA group](https://tata.com/) operates in more than [100 countries](https://factodata.com/largest-country-in-the-world-by-area-full-list/) across [seven continents.](https://factodata.com/7-continents-of-the-world-names-area-population-facts/) In 2023-24, the combined revenue of Tata companies, was more than $165 billion. There are 26 publicly listed Tata enterprises with a combined [market capitalization](https://factodata.com/top-assets-by-market-cap-gold-silver/) of more than $365 billion as on March 31, 2024.\n\nSome major TATA companies are TATA Consultancy Services (TCS), TATA steel, TATA Motors, TATA Power, TITAN, Indian Hotels, Trent, Air India and many more.\n\n### Quick Facts\n\n## TATA chairmen over the years\n\n| Number | Name | Tenure |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Jamsetji Tata | 1868–1904 |\n| 2 | Sir Dorabji Tata | 1904–1932 |\n| 3 | Nowroji Saklatwala | 1932-1938 |\n| 4 | J. R. D. Tata | 1938-1991 |\n| 5 | Ratan Tata | 1991-2012 |\n| 6 | Cyrus Mistry | 2012–2016 |\n| 7 | Ratan Tata | 2016-2017 |\n| 8 | Natarajan Chandrasekaran | 2017–present |\n\nSource: [TATA Group](https://tata.com/)\n\n**Last updated:** 20.06.2026\n\n## Related Posts:\n\n### [Top Indian Companies by Revenue in 2026](https://factodata.com/top-indian-companies-by-revenue-2026/)\n\n### [International Tourist Arrivals in India 2026: Latest Complete Statistics Report](https://factodata.com/international-tourist-arrivals-in-india/)\n\n### [Historical Gold Prices in India (1990–2026): CAGR and growth analysis](https://factodata.com/historical-gold-prices-return/)\n\n### [Which Indian Bank Operates the Most ATMs in 2026](https://factodata.com/which-bank-operates-the-most-atms-in-india-in-2025/)\n\n![Factodata logo](https://factodata.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/round-logo.webp)\n\nFactodata provides accurate statistics and insights on Economy, Demographics, Business and Markets.\n\nSign up to receive email updates, Statistics, Data, infographics and more!\n\nCopyright © 2026 FactoData.\n\"\"\"",{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"verdict":{"type":"string","format":"enum","enum":["supported","unsupported","contradicted"]},"evidenceQuote":{"type":"string"},"reasoning":{"type":"string"}},"required":["verdict","evidenceQuote","reasoning"]}}]}
