m AI Success Story: The Journey Behind India’s AI Revolution \n\nPublished August 18,2026 by  Rishika Kuna\n\nSarvam AI Success Story: The Journey Behind India’s AI Revolution\n\nSarvam AI Founders: The Story Behind India’s AI Powerhouse \n\nPublished August 18,2026 by  Rishika Kuna","score":0.818055},{"title":"Our company, history, and the people behind it","url":"https://zerodha.com/about","content":"And yet, we are always up to something new every day. Catch up on the latest updates on our blog or see what the media is saying about us or learn more about our business and product philosophies.\n\n## People\n\n##### Nithin Kamath\n\nFounder, CEO\n\nNithin bootstrapped and founded Zerodha in 2010 to overcome the hurdles he faced during his decade long stint as a trader. Today, Zerodha has changed the landscape of the Indian broking industry. [...] ## We pioneered the discount broking model in India. Now, we are breaking ground with our technology.\n\nWe kick-started operations on the 15th of August, 2010 with the goal of breaking all barriers that traders and investors face in India in terms of cost, support, and technology. We named the company Zerodha, a combination of Zero and \"Rodha\", the Sanskrit word for barrier.\n\nToday, our disruptive pricing models and in-house technology have made us the biggest stock broker in India.","score":0.8033131},{"title":"Nithin Kamath - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nithin_Kamath","content":"From January 2004 to January 2010, Kamath worked as a sub-broker for Kamath Associates, a franchise of Reliance Money, where he provided portfolio advisory services and engaged in proprietary trading.\n\n## Founding of Zerodha\n\n[edit]\n\nIn 2010, Kamath co-founded Zerodha with his brother Nikhil Kamath. The company introduced a discount broking model in India, offering a flat fee of ₹20 per trade regardless of order size, in contrast to percentage-based fee structures used by traditional brokers. [...] | Nithin Kamath |