ubsidiaries](/about/subsidiaries.html \"Subsidiaries\")\n  + [Clients Speak](/about/clients-speak.html \"Clients Speak\")\n  + [Alliances](/about/alliances.html \"Alliances\")\n  + [Infosys Innovation Fund](/about/innovation-fund.html \"Infosys Innovation Fund\")\n  + [Infosys Business Incubator](/about/business-incubator.html \"Infosys Business Incubator\")\n  + [Infosys Innovation Network (IIN)](/about/innovation-network.html \"Infosys Innovation Network (IIN)\")\n  + [Diversity Equity Inclusion](/about/diversity-inclusion.html \"Diversity Equity Inclusion\")\n  + [Awards](/about/awards.html \"Awards\")\n  + [Analyst Reports](/analyst-speak.html \"Analyst Reports\")\n\n  ### Flagship Brand Partnerships\n\n  + [Tennis](javascript:void(0);)\n\n  + [All Partnerships](/tennis.html \"All Partnerships\")\n  + [Australian Open](/australian-open.html \"Australian Open\")\n  + [Roland-Garros](/roland-garros.html \"Roland-Garros\")\n  + [ATP](/atp.html \"ATP\")\n  + [International Tennis Hall of Fame](/ithf.html \"International Tennis Hall of Fame\")\n  + [Brand Ambassador - Carlos Alcaraz](/carlos-alcaraz.html \"Brand Ambassador - Carlos Alcaraz\")\n  + [Brand Ambassador - Iga Świątek](/iga-swiatek.html \"Brand Ambassador - Iga Świątek\")\n  + [HSBC Championships](/queenschampionships.html \"HSBC Championships\")\n\n  + [Formula E](/formulae.html \"Formula E\")\n  + [Madison Square Garden](/madison-square-garden.html \"Madison Square Garden\")\n  + [The Economist Group](/the-economist-group.html \"The Economist Group\")\n  + [Dow Jones](/dow-jones.html \"Dow Jones\")\n  + [Financial Times](/financial-times.html \"Financial Times\")\n  + [The Cloud Hub](/cloud-hub.html \"The Cloud Hub\")\n  + [Handelsblatt](/handelsblatt.html \"Handelsblatt\")\n* [Investors](/investors.html \"Investors\")\n* [Careers](/careers/ \"Careers\")\n* [Newsroom](/newsroom.html \"Newsroom\")\n* [Blogs](https://blogs.infosys.com/ \"Blogs\")\n* [Contact Us](/contact.html \"Contact Us\")\n\nManagement Profiles\n\n# Salil Parekh\n\n**Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director**\n\n![Salil Parekh](/content/dam/infosys-web/en/global-resource/photos/salil-parekh.jpg)\n\nSalil is the Chief Executive Officer of Infosys and has been in that role since January 2018.\n\nSalil has helped transform Infosys into a leading digital, cloud, and AI company. Salil helps set the strategy and nurture a leadership team to drive its execution. Infosys is in the top decile of shareholder return during his tenure, leading in client satisfaction results, and leading in employee engagement scores.\n\nSalil has a strong track record of driving transformations, executing business turnarounds, and managing successful acquisitions.\n\nPrior to Infosys, Salil was a member of the management board at Capgemini and a partner at consulting practice Ernst & Young LLP prior to its acquisition by Capgemini. He had different leadership roles there across US, UK, Europe, Asia, over a span of 25 years.\n\nSalil has received several awards as a leading CEO.\n\nSalil holds Master of Engineering degrees in Computer Science and Mechanical Engineering from Cornell University, and a Bachelor of Technology degree in Aeronautical Engineering from the Indian Institute of Technology, Bombay.\n\nSalil is on the board of Advance CT, an organization that supports business and innovation in the state of Connecticut. Salil is on the Board of the US-India Strategic Partnership Forum (USISPF) an organization that works towards strengthening the US-India relationship and promoting collaboration in various sectors, including technology.\n\n**Salil Parekh is also an Executive Officer for Infosys.**\n\n![](/content/dam/infosys-web/en/global-resource/25/automotive-rfs-bg.jpg)\n\n## Request for services\n\nFind out more about how we can help your organization navigate its next. Let us know your areas of interest so that we can serve you better.\n\n![Loading](/content/dam/infosys-web/common/loading.gif)\n\"\"\"",{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"verdict":{"type":"string","format":"enum","enum":["supported","unsupported","contradicted"]},"evidenceQuote":{"type":"string"},"reasoning":{"type":"string"}},"required":["verdict","evidenceQuote","reasoning"]}}]}
