ue of $5.2 billion; over 320 outlets across 11 countries. [...] September 2025: Announcement of a 48-showroom rollout (27 new, 21 revamped) targeted for completion by December 2025, spanning India, the UAE, the USA, the UK, Australia, Saudi Arabia, Canada, and Malaysia, alongside the brand's first entry into New Zealand (its 14th country of operation). The announcement set a target of 60 new showrooms in the current financial year, extending the brand's Indian presence to 22 states and 3 union territories, alongside a stated revenue ambition of $8.85 [...] Gulf region, where a large Non-Resident Keralite and South Asian diaspora provided a natural first customer base. A case study on Malabar's expansion plans (authored by Vinod Thakur and Sabyasachi Sinha) notes that by 2019, the company operated 117 outlets in India and 143 outlets internationally across nine countries, placing it among the top five jewellery retailers globally by that measure. Critically, the same case documents that most of Malabar's domestic revenue at that time was\n\n[S9] Titan Company Limited (TITAN.NS) Recent Insider Transactions - Yahoo Finance\nURL: https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TITAN.NS/insider-transactions\nSkip to navigation Skip to right column. - Best non-toxic cutting boards. - Best high-yield savings accounts. ### New on Yahoo. About our ads Advertising Careers. # Yahoo Finance. # Titan Company Limited (TITAN.NS). At close: December 12 at 3:30:03 PM GMT+5:30. ### Insider Purchases Last 6 Months. ### Net Institutional Purchases Prior Quarter to Latest Quarter. ### Insider Transactions Reported - Last Two Years. ### Related Tickers. KALYANKJIL.NS Kalyan Jewellers India Limited. PCJEWELLER.NS PC Jeweller Limited. VAIBHAVGBL.NS Vaibhav Global Limited. GOLDIAM.NS Goldiam International Limited. THANGAMAYL.NS Thangamayil Jewellery Limited. SKYGOLD.NS Sky Gold and Diamonds Limited. SENCO.NS Senco Gold Limited. STARLENT.BO StarlinePS Enterprises Limited. RGL.NS Renaissance Global Limited.\