lers, the world's largest specialty jewelry retailer, operates over 2,700 store locations across North America, UK, and Australia, reflecting the continued commercial viability of physical stores. Local and family-run jewelers continue to dominate in India, China, and the Middle East, supported by trust, craft reputation, and personalized customer service. Point-of-sale financing, trade-in programs, and in-store customization further differentiate physical retail from online\n\n[S12] Jewelry market in India- statistics & facts | Statista\nURL: https://www.statista.com/topics/5031/jewelry-market-in-india\nShare of gems and jewelry market in India in 2023, by material type\n\nShare of gems and jewelry market in India 2023, by material type\n\nShare of gems and jewelry market in India in 2023, by material type\n\nMarket share of jewelry across India as of 2024, by region \n\nMarket share of jewelry in India 2024, by region\n\nMarket share of jewelry across India as of 2024, by region\n\nMarket share of jewelry across India in 2024, by occasion\n\nMarket share of jewelry in India 2024, by occasion [...] Total revenue of Kalyan Jewellers India Limited from 2017 to 2025 (in billion Indian rupees)\n\nRevenue from operation of P. N. Gadgil Jewellers Limited from financial year 2018 to 2025 (in billion Indian rupees)\n\nRevenue from operation of P. N. Gadgil Jewellers FY 2018-2025\n\nRevenue from operation of P. N. Gadgil Jewellers Limited from financial year 2018 to 2025 (in billion Indian rupees)\n\nDomestic revenue of PC Jeweller Limited from financial year 2012 to 2024 (in billion Indian rupees) [...] PC Jeweller's domestic revenue FY 2012-2024\n\nDomestic revenue of PC Jeweller Limited from financial year 2012 to 2024 (in billion Indian rupees)\n\n## Key insights\n\nMarket size of gems and jewelry in India from 2020 to 2024, with estimates until 2029 (in trillion Indian rupees)\n\nDetailed statistics\n\nMarket size of gems and jewelry India 2020-2029\n\nSize of online j