arket share as of 2022. More than 80% of its total revenue comes from the jewellery segment. As of 2019, it is also the fifth-largest [...] [edit]\n\nTitan Engineering & Automation Limited is a wholly owned subsidiary of Titan. It was formerly known as Titan-Precision Engineering Division. The company now deals in machine building, automation and component manufacturing.\n\nTitan Company acquired the historic Swiss watch brand Favre-Leuba in November 2011 for US$2.7 million.\n\n[S15] Titan Company Limited Information\nURL: https://rocketreach.co/titan-company-limited-profile_b5c493e7f42e0dca\nTitan Company Ltd is the organization that brought about a paradigm shift in the Indian watch market when it introduced its futuristic quartz technology, complemented by international styling. With India's two most recognized and loved brands Titan and Tanishq to its credit, Titan Company Ltd is the fifth largest integrated own brand watch manufacturer in the world. The success story began in 1984 with a joint venture between the Tata Group and the Tamil Nadu Industrial Development Corporation. [...] Corporation. Presenting Titan quartz watches that sported an international look, Titan Company Ltd transformed the Indian watch market. After Sonata, a value brand of functionally styled watches at affordable prices, Titan Company Ltd reached out to the youth segment with Fastrack, its third brand, trendy and chic. The company has sold 150 million watches world over and manufactures over 15 million watches every year. Backed by over 6,000 employees, two exclusive design studios for watches and [...] for watches and jewellery, 10 manufacturing units, and innumerable admirers’ world over, Titan Company Ltd continues to grow and set new standards for innovation and quality. The organization is all geared to repeat the Titan and Tanishq success story with each new offering.\n\n[S16] Titan Company Limited - A strong portfolio of brands & industry leading capabilities, Titan is driven by the values and ethos of the Tata Group\nURL: https://in.linkedin.com/company/titan-industries\nTitan Company Ltd is the organization that brought about a paradigm shift in the Indian watch market when it introduced its futuristic quartz technology, complemented by international styling. With India's two most recognized and loved brands Titan and Tanishq to its credit, Titan Company Ltd is the fifth largest integrated own brand watch manufacturer in the world. The success story began in 1984 with a joint venture between the Tata Group and the Tamil Nadu Industrial Development Corporation. [...] Corporation. Presenting Titan quartz watches that sported an international look, Titan Company Ltd transformed the Indian watch market. After Sonata, a value brand of functionally styled watches at affordable prices, Titan Company Ltd reached out to the youth segment with Fastrack, its third brand, trendy and chic. The company has sold 150 million watches world over and manufactures over 15 million watches every year. Backed by over 6,000 employees, two exclusive design studios for watches and [...] for watches and jewellery, 10 manufacturing units, and innumerable admirers’ world over, Titan Company Ltd continues to grow and set new standards for innovation and quality. The organization is all geared to repeat the Titan and Tanishq success story with each new offering.\n\n[S17] Titan Company Limited (TITAN.NS) Stock Price, News, Quote & History - Yahoo Finance\nURL: https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TITAN.NS\nTitan Company Limited, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells watches, jewelry, eyewear, fragrances, women's bags, and other accessories and products in India and internationally. The company operates through four segments: Watches and Wearables, Jewellery, Eyecare, and Others. The company designs, manufactures, and retails watches and wearables under the Nebula, Titan, Titan Clock, Zoop, Titan Octane, Titan Raga, Xylys, Edge, Fastrack, Sonata, Titan Smart, Fastrack smart, SF, [...] solutions for the aerospace, defense, transportation, electrical and electronics, and medical sectors. Further, it provides automation and precision engineering solutions. It offers its products through owned and franchised retail stores, as well as online. The company was formerly known as Titan Industries Limited and changed its name to Titan Company Limited in August 2013. Titan Company Limited was incorporated in 1984 and is based in Bengaluru, India. [...] Fastrack smart, SF, Titan World, and Helios brands; jewellery products under the Mia, CaratLane, Tanishq, and Zoya brands; and eyecare products under the Titan Glares, Titan Eye+ and Fastrack Eyecare brands. It also offers sarees, dress materials, and ready-to-wear kurtas under the Taneira brand; perfumes under the SKINN brand; belts and wallets under the TITAN brand; and bags under the Fastrack and IRTH brands. In addition, the company provides manufacturing services and automation solutions\n\n[S18] Titan Company Ltd share price | About Titan Company | Key Insights - Screener\nURL: https://www.screener.in/company/TITAN/consolidated\nAbout\n\nTitan Company Ltd is among India’s most respected lifestyle companies. It has established leadership positions in the Watches, Jewellery and Eyewear categories led by its trusted brands and differentiated customer experience. It was founded in 1984 as a joint-venture between TATA Group and Tamilnadu Industrial Development Corporation (TIDCO). (\n\nKey Points [...] Key Points\n\nPart of the Tata Group( (   \n The company benefits from its association with the Tata Group, one of India’s most established and diversified business conglomerates. As of FY26, the Tata Group held a 25% stake in the company, including a 21% shareholding through Tata Sons Pvt Ltd., while Tamil Nadu Industrial Development Corporation Limited (TIDCO) held 28%.\n\nWebsite   BSE   NSE\n\n[S19] kalyan jewellers Employee Directory, Headcount & Staff | LeadIQ\nURL: https://leadiq.com/c/kalyan-jewellers/60153c4e411f372b40487952/employee-directory\nKalyan Jewellers is a jewelry retailer founded in 1993 and headquartered in Thrissur, Kerala, with a broad footprint that now spans about 132 showrooms across India and the GCC. It operates in the luxury segment, offering a wide array of designed pieces across gold and diamond jewelry, including several named collections for weddings, heritage, and everyday wear. The product range includes gold jewelry, diamond jewelry, earrings, bangles, and necklaces, among other pieces. The company is based [...] company is based in Thrissur with significant operations in Maharashtra, and supports a mid-sized workforce. In 2026, Kalyan Jewellers expanded its retail footprint with new showrooms in Ambernath, Maharashtra, and Medipally, Hyderabad. The firm is positioned as a major regional player in luxury jewelry, combining a large showroom network with a broad assortment designed to address varied customer preferences for wedding and occasion jewelry. [...] ### What is kalyan jewellers known for?\n\nMinus sign iconPlus sign iconkalyan jewellers was founded in 1993 and operates in the Retail Luxury Goods and Jewelry industry. Explore kalyan jewellers's company overview page for more information.\n\n### What is kalyan jewellers's most common email format?\n\n[S20] Kalyan Jewellers company information, history, management and director details and CEO salary\nURL: https://trendlyne.com/equity/about/447071/KALYANKJIL/kalyan-jewellers-india-ltd\nKalyan Jewellers India Ltd. is one of India’s largest jewellery retailers, operating a pan-India network and a significant presence in the Middle East. The company specializes in gold, st, and other precious jewellery, utilizing a hyperlocal strategy to cater to regional consumer preferences. It manages a multi-channel distribution network comprising brick-and-mortar showrooms, a grassroots network of My Kalyan service centers, and an online presence through its subsidiary, Candere. [...] Business Model: Kalyan Jewellers follows a hyperlocal model, customizing product portfolios to match local tastes across different Indian states. It is increasingly shifting toward a capital-light Franchisee Owned Company Operated (FOCO) model to accelerate expansion. Approximately 195 of its Indian Kalyan showrooms and 68 Candere showrooms are now FOCO-based.\n Key Products and Sub-brands:\n  + Wedding Jewellery: Marketed under the Muhurat brand. [...] 1. Kalyan Jewellers India Ltd.\n2. Company Profile\n\n# About Kalyan Jewellers - Company Information, Overview, History and Profile\n\n About\n Gold Prices/Hedging\n\nWebsite: www.kalyanjewellers.net\n\n## About the company - Business Profile\n\n[S21] Kalyan Jewellers India Limited - The Most Trusted Brand\nURL: https://in.linkedin.com/company/kalyan-jewellers-india-pvt-ltd\nKalyan Jewellers is one of the largest jewellery retailers in India, with its headquarters in Thrissur, Kerala. The company draws from its strong roots of over a century in the business of textile trading and distribution. From its modest beginning with a single jewellery showroom in 1993, Kalyan Jewellers has today grown to over 400 showrooms across India, Middle East, USA & UK. Through its long-standing presence in the Indian market for over three decades, Kalyan Jewellers has set industry [...] has set industry benchmarks in quality, transparency, pricing, and innovation. Kalyan offers an array of traditional and contemporary jewellery designs in gold, diamonds and precious stones catering to the distinct needs of different customers. [...] #UKLaunch #InternationalExpansion #JewelleryIndustry #Leicester [Likes: 302, Comments: 12]; Kalyan Jewellers India Limited (10mo): Forbes Asia features T.S. Kalyanaraman, Managing Director of Kalyan Jewellers, in a story that traces how a brand built on trust and tradition has redefined wedding jewellery in India and is now taking that legacy to global markets. A reflection on scale, craftsmanship and the evolving meaning of weddings in modern India. It’s a journey we’re honoured to share.\n\n[S22] Kalyan Jewellers India Ltd share price | About Kalyan Jewellers | Key Insights - Screener\nURL: https://www.screener.in/company/KALYANKJIL/consolidated\nKey Points\n\nBusiness Profile(  \n Kalyan Jewellers India Limited is one of India’s largest organised jewellery retailers, established in 1993. The company operates a Pan-India, hyperlocal jewellery retail model with scaled presence in India, the Middle East and the USA.\n\nWebsite   BSE   NSE   F&O\n\n Market Cap   ₹ 60,235 Cr.\n Current Price   ₹ 583\n High / Low  ₹ 649 / 327\n Stock P/E   41.2\n Book Value   ₹ 61.1\n Dividend Yield   0.43 %\n ROCE   21.2 %\n ROE   24.8 %\n Face Value   ₹ 10.0 [...] About\n\nKalyan Jewellers India Ltd. designs manufacture and sells a range of gold, studded and other jewellery products across various price points. It is one of the largest jewellery retailers in India based on revenue as of FY20. The co. was founded by the current Chairman, MD and Promoter, Mr T.S. Kalyanaraman (\n\nKey Points\n\n[S23] Gold Jewellery | about-us | Kalyan jewellers\nURL: https://www.kalyanjewellers.net/about-us.php\nIndian jewellery, its craftsmanship and variety is an amazing showcase of India’s heritage, culture and diversity. With a deep understanding of local tastes and preferences, Kalyan offers an array of traditional and contemporary jewellery designs in gold, diamonds, precious stones and other precious metals. [...] Today, Kalyan Jewellers has 316 retail stores spread across INDIA, MIDDLE EAST AND USA. Pampered by your unbound love and support and with the blessings of the Almighty, we believe we are in the right path towards the accomplishment of our vision to open stores and serve customers across the world.\n\n## ED's Message\n\n#### Rajesh Kalyanaraman - Executive Director [...] We at Kalyan have always believed that the customer needs to be educated and aware, as this is the first step in preventing malpractices in business. As a part of this philosophy we have conducted several campaigns over the years, to educate customers about purity, pricing and other aspects. These efforts of Kalyan have gone a long way in the industry, that is now becoming more transparent towards the customer’s interests. We believe that this is our legacy to the industry.\n\n[S24] About us\nURL: https://sencogoldanddiamonds.com/about-us\n# The History\n\nSenco Gold and Diamonds is a brand owned by Senco Gold Limited (‘the Company’) with a legacy of over 85+ years. Our company was incorporated as Senco Gold Private Limited on August 22, 1994, in Kolkata, West Bengal, under the provisions of the Companies Act, 1956.\n\nLater, in order to expand its activities in the field of jewellery business, the Company was converted to a public limited company in August 2007 with the name, Senco Gold Limited. [...] ##### Art Of Jewellery\n\nAbout Us - Senco Gold and Diamonds\n\nWest Bengal is a prominent jewellery manufacturing hub in east India, reputed for lightweight and handmade jewellery. The karigars of the state are skilled and known for their craftsmanship. Apart from catering to jewellery demand in the state, jewellery manufacturers from this region also cater to neighbouring states and other parts of the country. It is also one of the major gold and diamond jewellery exporting regions in India. [...] Suvankar Sen is the Managing Director and CEO of Senco Gold Limited. He holds a BSc degree in Economics from Calcutta University and a post-graduate diploma in Business Management from the Institute of Management & Technology, Ghaziabad. He has been associated with the Company since 2005. Under his leadership and strategic direction, Senco Gold got listed on NSE, BSE in July 2023. The company’s turnover also reached 4,000 Cr in FY2023. Suvankar Sen is also a member of GJEPC India (Gem &\n\n[S25] SENCO GOLD LIMITED - 2026 Company Profile, Financials & Shareholding - Tracxn\nURL: https://tracxn.com/d/legal-entities/india/senco-gold-limited/__cH9OAPulmOjnbPbHZLVt7fKJS4i56z1yuxcso4xHfVg\nSENCO GOLD LIMITED is a Public Limited Company and was incorporated on Aug 22, 1994 in India. It is registered at Registrar of Companies, ROC Kolkata. Its registered address is Diamond Prestige, 41A, A.J.C. Bose Road, 10th floor, Unit no. 1001, Kolkata, Kolkata, West Bengal, India, 700017.  Its corporate identification number is (CIN) L36911WB1994PLC064637 and its current status is Active. It has 20 GST numbers registered across 18 states. These include 18AADCS6985J1ZN in Assam (active) and [...] | Name | Short Description | Founded Year | Location | Current Stage |\n ---  --- \n| Logo for Senco Gold And Diamonds Senco Gold And Diamonds | Retailer of gold, diamond, platinum jewellery, coins and bars for men and women | 1994 | India | Public |\n| Logo for My Digi Gold My Digi Gold | App-based alternative investment platform for gold and diamonds | 1994 | India | Funding Raised | [...] | 6th | Logo for Senco Gold And Diamonds  Senco Gold And Diamonds 1994, Kolkata  (India), Public | Retailer of gold, diamond, platinum jewellery, coins and bars for men and women | $22.9M | Oman India Joint Investment Fund, Elevation Capital ... & 10 others | 67/100 |\n| 7th | Logo for Jewelbox  Jewelbox 2022, Kolkata  (India), Seed | Online platform offering lab-grown diamond jewellery | $3.62M | V3 Ventures, JITO Incubation & Innovation Foundation ... & 29 others | 65/100 |\n\n[S26] Jewellery Store Online: Shop Latest Jewellery Designs for Women & Men | Senco Gold & Diamonds\nURL: https://sencogoldanddiamonds.com\nThe Senco Story\n\nSenco Gold and Diamonds is brand owned by Senco Gold Limited (‘the Company’) having a legacy of over eight decades. Our company was originally incorporated as Senco Gold Private Limited on August 22, 1994, at Kolkata, West Bengal, under the provisions of the Companies Act, 1956.\n\nLater, in order to expand its activities in the field of jewellery business, the Company was converted to a public limited company in August 2007 with the name Senco Gold Limited. [...] Subsequently, pursuant to a resolution passed at a meeting of the Board of Directors held on June 27, 2007, and a special resolution of the shareholders at the EGM held on August 8, 2007, the name of the company was changed to Senco Gold Limited, resulting in its conversion into a public limited company. A fresh certificate of incorporation dated August 31, 2007, consequent to the change of name, was issued by the Registrar of Companies, West Bengal. The Company was converted to a public [...] to a public limited company in order to expand its activities in the field of jewellery business.\n\n[S27] Senco Gold & Diamonds - Products, Competitors, Financials, Employees, Headquarters Locations\nURL: https://www.cbinsights.com/company/senco-gold\nSenco Gold & Diamonds is a company with a history of over eighty years, specializing in the creation of jewellery in gold, diamonds, platinum, and silver across various business sectors. The company offers a range of jewellery products including earrings, rings, bracelets, chains, necklaces, and coins & bars. Senco Gold & Diamonds primarily serves the retail jewellery market, catering to a diverse clientele. It was founded in 1994 and is based in Kolkata, India.\n\n## Headquarters Location\n\n[S28] Senco Gold Ltd share price | About Senco Gold | Key Insights - Screener\nURL: https://www.screener.in/company/SENCO/consolidated\nKey Points\n\nBusiness Profile:(  \n Senco Gold Ltd. is India’s 2nd most trusted jewellery brand (TRA ranking, 5 years in   \n a row) and the largest organised jewellery   \n retailer in Eastern India.   \n The company operates on an omni-  \n channel model, offering gold, diamond,   \n silver, polki, platinum, and gemstone jewellery, and lifestyle products like   \n leather goods, fragrances, and lab-  \n grown diamonds.\n\nWebsite   BSE   NSE [...] # Senco Gold Ltd\n\nAI\n\nSenco Gold Summary  Chart Analysis Peers Quarters Profit & Loss Balance Sheet Cash Flow Ratios Investors Documents\n\nAI\n\n# Senco Gold Ltd\n\n₹ 336  -1.83%\n\n24 Sep - close price\n\nsencogoldanddiamonds.com   BSE: 543936   NSE: SENCO\n\nAbout\n\nIncorporated in 1994, Senco Gold Limited is a Pan-India jewelry retailer and is the largest organized jewelry retail player in the Eastern region of India based on the number of stores(\n\nKey Points\n\n[S29] Malabar Gold & Diamonds - Wikipedia\nURL: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malabar_Gold_%26_Diamonds\nMalabar Gold & Diamonds is an Indian jewellery group headquartered in Kozhikode, Kerala. The company was founded by M. P. Ahammed in 1993. As of May 2023, it owns more than 330 showrooms across 11 countries.\n\n## History\n\n[edit] [...] | Type | Private |\n| Industry | Jewellers |\n| Founded | 1993; 33 years ago (1993) |\n| Headquarters | Kozhikode, Kerala, India |\n| Number of locations | 445 showrooms (2026) |\n| Area served | India, United States, Canada, UAE, Singapore, Kuwait, Bahrain, Oman, Qatar, Saudi Arabia, Malaysia, United Kingdom, Australia, New Zealand |\n| Products | Gold, diamonds, gemstone, platinum and silver |\n| Revenue | Increase US$7.5 Billion |\n| Owner | M. P. Ahammed |\n| Number of employees | 27,500 (2025) | [...] In 2022, with a revenue of $4.024 billion, Malabar was ranked 19th luxury goods company in Deloitte's \"Global Powers of Luxury Goods\" report.\n\nAs of 2026, Malabar Gold & Diamonds reported a turnover of approximately ₹63,000 crore.\n\n## Controversies\n\n[edit]\n\n### 2016\n\n[edit]\n\nThe business courted controversy in 2016 when their UAE branches celebrated Pakistan's Independence Day \"Independence Day (Pakistan)\").\n\n### 2025\n\n[edit]\n\n[S30] Online Jewellery Shopping Store in UAE | Malabar Gold & Diamonds\nURL: https://www.malabargoldanddiamonds.com/us/about-us.html\nMalabar Gold & Diamonds was established in 1993 and is the flagship company of Malabar Group, a leading diversified Indian business conglomerate. With an annual turnover of $9.41 billion, the company currently ranks as the 4th largest jewellery retailer globally. It operates a strong retail network of over 450 showrooms across 14 countries, supported by offices, design centres, wholesale units, and manufacturing facilities across India, the Middle East, the Far East, the USA, the UK, Canada, [...] Mine Diamond Jewellery\n Precia Gold Jewellery\n Era Diamond Jewellery\n Divine Gold Jewellery\n Ethnix Designer Jewellery\n Starlet Gold Jewellery\n\n+91 22 62300916 +91 9167780916\n\n+91 22 62300916\n\n+91 22 62300916\n\n(8AM to 10PM IST)\n\nOur Brands\n\nSelect Your Currency\n\nMalabar Gold & Diamonds\n\nMalabar Gold & Diamonds Malabar Gold & Diamonds   Malabar Gold & Diamonds\n\n## Change Country and Currency\n\n\n\nOther Countries\n\n + Stores\n  + Country\n  + Profile\n  + Wishlist\n  + Cart (0)\")\n  + Log In [...] Need more information click button\n\nKnow more About Malabar Gold & Diamonds\n\nPress the '+' button to add to home screen. +X\n\n© 2026 Malabar Gold And Diamonds Limited. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[S31] Malabar Gold and Diamonds is rated \"Average\" with 3.3 / 5 on Trustpilot\nURL: https://www.trustpilot.com/review/malabargoldanddiamonds.com\nMalabar Gold & Diamonds is the flagship company of Malabar Group, a leading diversified Indian business conglomerate. Established in 1993 in the Indian state of Kerala, Malabar Gold & Diamonds today has a strong retail network of over 360+ outlets spread across 13 countries. Making it one of the largest chains of jewellery retailer in the world.\n\n  \n\n## Contact info\n\n[S32] Malabar Gold & Diamonds Information\nURL: https://rocketreach.co/malabar-gold-diamonds-profile_b451d349fc7774d3\nMalabar Group, with its headquarters in Calicut, Kerala, India and having 15 business verticals spread across 13 countries, is the fastest-growing business conglomerate in the world with an annual turnover of USD 7.5 Billion and a size of over 