ess Model Work?","score":0.70871735},{"title":"Instamart - 2026 Company Profile, Funding & Competitors","url":"https://tracxn.com/d/companies/instamart/__D5g1hntOjcAEcbfGgaSCI9-DycJiBD7Z01qDiHLq2hc","content":"Instamart is a funded company. Instamart has 1 institutional investor.\n\n## Instamart's founders and board of directors\n\n### Instamart's employee count trend\n\nEmployee count trend for Instamart\nlock\nchrome_extension_cta_illustration\n\n## Instamart's Competitors and alternates [...] | 18th | Logo for Instamart  Instamart 2005, Denver  (United States), Funding Raised | Online retailer offering ultra-fast grocery delivery  TGV | 48/100 | [...] JavaScript is disabled in your browser. enable it to enjoy the full features of Tracxn.\n\nTracxn.com\nAndroid\nApple\nChrome Web Store\nFirefox Extension\ntracxn ai suite\n\nAI-powered market intelligence across companies, investors, and sectors.\n\nLogo for Instamart\n\n# Instamart - Company Profile\n\nlock\nlock\nlock\nlock\nlock\n\n## Instamart - About the company\n\n### Company Details\n\nX\nFacebook\nPDF Illustration Image\n\n## Instamart's funding and investors","score":0.6649108},{"title":"Instamart","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/swiggy-instamart","content":"### Website\n\n### Crunchbase\nN/A\n### LinkedIn\nN/A\n\n### Industry\nTechnology, Information and Internet\n\n### Company Size\n1,001-5,000 employees  \n5419 associated members (LinkedIn members who've listed Instamart as their current workplace on their profile)\n\n### Founded\nN/A\n\n### Funding\nLast Round Date: N/A\nLast Round Type: N/A\nTotal Rounds: N/A\nLast Round Raised: N/A\n\n### Investors\nN/A\n\n### Specialties\nN/A\n\n## Locations\nBengaluru, Karnataka, IN\n\n### Get Directions\nDirections [...] # Instamart\nN/A\nTechnology, Information and Internet • Bengaluru, Karnataka • 112,559 followers • 1,001-5,000 employees\n\n## Overview\nWe’re now live in 120 cities! That’s 120 places where spontaneous plans, unexpected guests, late-night