{"ts":"2026-09-26T16:20:29.095Z","session":"3b9ec3d1-7df0-41f4-8dd1-d503b69c5c7f","event":"llm.end","callId":"fef1d10c-e659-469c-9691-0ea8752b813c","name":"gemini.generate","duration_ms":6608,"result":{"text":"{\n  \"answer\": \"In Indian quick commerce since January, Zepto, Swiggy (Instamart), Snabbit, and Swish raised funding. Zepto secured funding in June 2024 ($665 million led by Glade Brook Capital Partners, Nexus Venture Partners, and StepStone Group, with Avenir, Lightspeed Venture Partners, Avra, Goodwater Capital, Lachy Groom, Contrary, and DST Global), August 2024 ($340 million led by General Catalyst and Mars Growth Capital, with Epiq Capital, Dragon Fund, DST Global, Lightspeed, and StepStone), November 2024 ($350 million led by Motilal Oswal Private Wealth and others), and October 2025 ($300 million Series H and $45.6 million Series G). Swiggy raised an undisclosed late-stage amount on September 30, 2024, from lead investors Accel, Prosus Ventures, and Elevation Capital. Snabbit raised $5.5 million in a Series A funding round in early 2024 led by Elevation Capital, with Nexus Venture Partners and angel investors. Swish raised $24 million.\",\n  \"claims\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Zepto raised $665 million in primary equity capital in June 2024 co-led by Glade Brook Capital Partners, Nexus Venture Partners, and StepStone Group, with participation from Avenir, Lightspeed Venture Partners, Avra, Goodwater Capital, Lachy Groom, Contrary, and DST Global.\",\n      \"citedUrl\": \"https://multiples.vc/private-comps/zepto\",\n      \"supportingUrls\": [\n        \"https://multiples.vc/private-comps/zepto\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Zepto secured $340 million in August 2024, led by General Catalyst and Mars Growth Capital, with participation from Epiq Capital, Dragon Fund, DST Global, Lightspeed, and StepStone.\",\n      \"citedUrl\": \"https://multiples.vc/private-comps/zepto\",\n      \"supportingUrls\": [\n        \"https://multiples.vc/private-comps/zepto\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Zepto raised $350 million in November 2024 led by Motilal Oswal Private Wealth with participation from other investors.\",\n      \"citedUrl\": \"https://entrackr.com/news/zepto-raises-350-mn-surpasses-135-bn-in-funding-for-2024-7599303\",\n      \"supportingUrls\": [\n        \"https://entrackr.com/news/zepto-raises-350-mn-surpasses-135-bn-in-funding-for-2024-7599303\",\n        \"https://tracxn.com/d/companies/zepto/__vOTzafGt-8S4kwYniiZ_yRogd6c_Jsw_vRD0gckHtfE/funding-and-investors\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Zepto raised $300 million in October 2025 for Series H and $45.6 million in August 2025 for Series G.\",\n      \"citedUrl\": \"https://tracxn.com/d/companies/zepto/__vOTzafGt-8S4kwYniiZ_yRogd6c_Jsw_vRD0gckHtfE/funding-and-investors\",\n      \"supportingUrls\": [\n        \"https://tracxn.com/d/companies/zepto/__vOTzafGt-8S4kwYniiZ_yRogd6c_Jsw_vRD0gckHtfE/funding-and-investors\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Swiggy's latest funding round was an undisclosed amount in Late Stage, raised on 30 September 2024.\",\n      \"citedUrl\": \"https://inc42.com/company/swiggy/funding\",\n      \"supportingUrls\": [\n        \"https://inc42.com/company/swiggy/funding\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Swiggy's key investors include Accel, Prosus Ventures, Elevation Capital and 2 others.\",\n      \"citedUrl\": \"https://inc42.com/company/swiggy/funding\",\n      \"supportingUrls\": [\n        \"https://inc42.com/company/swiggy/funding\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Snabbit successfully raised $5.5 million in Series A funding led by Elevation Capital, with participation from Nexus Venture Partners and angel investors like Vidit Aatrey, Sanjeev Barnwal, Gaurav Munjal, and Niraj Singh.\",\n      \"citedUrl\": \"https://sellerrocket.in/quick-commerce-startup-snabbit-funding.html\",\n      \"supportingUrls\": [\n        \"https://sellerrocket.in/quick-commerce-startup-snabbit-funding.html\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Snabbit previously received an earlier $1 million seed investment by Nexus Venture Partners in early 2024.\",\n      \"citedUrl\": \"https://sellerrocket.in/quick-commerce-startup-snabbit-funding.html\",\n      \"supportingUrls\": [\n        \"https://sellerrocket.in/quick-commerce-startup-snabbit-funding.html\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Swish, a 10-minute food delivery startup, has raised $24 million.\",\n      \"citedUrl\": \"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/topic/zomato-swiggy-blinkit-zepto-ola-uber-news\",\n      \"supportingUrls\": [\n        \"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/topic/zomato-swiggy-blinkit-zepto-ola-uber-news\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"entitiesLearned\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Zepto\",\n      \"type\": \"Company\",\n      \"facts\": [\n        {\n          \"fact\": \"Raised $665 million in June 2024 co-led by Glade Brook Capital Partners, Nexus Venture Partners, and StepStone Group\",\n          \"sourceUrl\": \"https://multiples.vc/private-comps/zepto\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"fact\": \"Secured $340 million in August 2024 led by General Catalyst and Mars Growth Capital\",\n          \"sourceUrl\": \"https://multiples.vc/private-comps/zepto\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"fact\": \"Raised $350 million in November 2024 led by Motilal Oswal Private Wealth\",\n          \"sourceUrl\": \"https://entrackr.com/news/zepto-raises-350-mn-surpasses-135-bn-in-funding-for-2024-7599303\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Swiggy\",\n      \"type\": \"Company\",\n      \"facts\": [\n        {\n          \"fact\": \"Raised an undisclosed late-stage amount on September 30, 2024\",\n          \"sourceUrl\": \"https://inc42.com/company/swiggy/funding\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"fact\": \"Key investors include Accel, Prosus Ventures, and Elevation Capital\",\n          \"sourceUrl\": \"https://inc42.com/company/swiggy/funding\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Snabbit\",\n      \"type\": \"Company\",\n      \"facts\": [\n        {\n          \"fact\": \"Raised $5.5 million in Series A funding led by Elevation Capital\",\n          \"sourceUrl\": \"https://sellerrocket.in/quick-commerce-startup-snabbit-funding.html\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Swish\",\n      \"type\": \"Company\",\n      \"facts\": [\n        {\n          \"fact\": \"Raised $24 million in funding\",\n          \"sourceUrl\": \"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/topic/zomato-swiggy-blinkit-zepto-ola-uber-news\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unableToFind\": []\n}","usage":{"inputTokens":14780,"outputTokens":1998,"totalTokens":16778,"usd":0.009429,"rupees":0.829752},"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite"}}
