unds does Swiggy have ?\n\n### How many funding rounds does Swiggy have ?\n\nSwiggy has raised a total of $3.58 billion across 18 funding rounds and the last round was raised on 30 September 2024.\n\n### Who are the lead investors in Swiggy?\n\n### Who are the lead investors in Swiggy?\n\nSwiggy's key investors include Accel, Prosus Ventures, Elevation Capital and 2 others.\n\n### What was Swiggy's latest funding round?\n\n### What was Swiggy's latest funding round?\n\nSwiggy's latest funding round was an undisclosed amount in Late Stage, raised on 30 September 2024.\n\n### What funding stage is Swiggy currently in?\n\n### What funding stage is Swiggy currently in?\n\nSwiggy is at the Late stage. Its most recent round was raised on 30 September 2024.\n\n### What is Swiggy's valuation?\n\n### What is Swiggy's valuation?\n\nSwiggy's last known valuation was $10.06 billion as of 24 January 2022.\n\n## Disclaimer\n\nInc42 Datalabs consolidates intelligence from public records, statutory filings, proprietary research, and vetted third‑party datasets. All information is provided as is—please run your own checks before acting on it. Inc42 Datalabs bears no responsibility for decisions or outcomes based on this data.\n\nQuick Links\n\"\"\"",{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"verdict":{"type":"string","format":"enum","enum":["supported","unsupported","contradicted"]},"evidenceQuote":{"type":"string"},"reasoning":{"type":"string"}},"required":["verdict","evidenceQuote","reasoning"]}}]}
