have the opportunity to wake up in the morning and build again.\n[0:29] Welcome back to another episode of How to Build the Future. Today I'm thrilled to be joined by Audit Polycha, the co-founder and CEO of Zeppto, which\n[0:38] delivers groceries to your door in just 10 minutes. There are up to$ 1.5 million orders a day across 50 cities throughout [...] Posted: 2025-04-18\nImagine ordering groceries and having them show up at your doorstep in just 10 minutes. That’s the promise of Zepto, the fastest growing e-commerce company in India. In this episode of How To Build The Future, Garry sits down with Aadit Palicha, the co-founder and CEO of Zepto, to discuss how they got started in a Whatsapp group, what it’s like going up against incumbents like Amazon and Zomato and how the future of e-commerce is changing in the age of intelligence.\n\n[S9] Zepto - Company Profile\nURL: https://www.boringbusinessnerd.com/startups/zepto\nNikhil Mittal: VP of Engineering at Zepto. Former VP of Engineering at KiranaKart.‍\n\n Nitesh Sinha: VP of Product at Zepto. Former Senior Director of Product Management at Meesho.\n\n## Press\n\n Forbes India (March 13, 2023): Where is 10-minute grocery delivery headed?\n\n Business Standard (May 31, 2023): Online grocery firm Zepto announces leadership elevation as it eyes IPO\n\n TechCrunch (May 2, 2022): Zepto, a 10-minute grocery delivery app, raises $200 million at $900 million valuation [...] As of May 2022, Zepto was growing 50% MoM with annualized revenue between $200-$400 million. In Q2 2022, Zepto grew its revenue by 800% while slashing expenses by 5x.\n\n Zepto is currently operational in 10 cities across India.\n\n## Leadership Team\n\n Aadit Palicha: Co-Founder & CEO of Zepto. Former Co-Founder & CEO of KiranaKart.\n\n Kaivalya V.:  Co-Founder & CTO of Zepto. Former Co-Founder & CTO of KiranaKart.\n\n Amritansu Nanda: CMO at Zepto. Former Head of Digital Marketing at FACES Cosmetics.\n\n[S10] How Zepto Delivers Groceries in 10 Minutes\nURL: https://techresearchonline.com/blog/zepto-10-minute-delivery-business-model\nZepto's success story wouldn't be complete without the vision and leadership of its two founders, Kaivalya Vohra and Aadit Palicha. These Stanford dropouts have disrupted the quick commerce industry in India, through their passion for innovation and a focus on speed and convenience. Let’s take a closer look at each of them.\n\n### Kaivalya Vohra [...] Since childhood, Kaivalya has demonstrated his enthusiasm for both business and technology by studying how systems operate and how performance could be enhanced. At Zepto, Kaivalya concentrates on technical operations that drive business efficiency and scalability while positioning the company for future developments.\n\n### Aadit Palicha [...] ### Kaivalya Vohra\n\nAs co-founder of Zepto, Kaivalya Vohra stands out for his deep expertise in technology and business foundations. After deciding to drop out of Stanford University, Kaivalya pursued building a company that could transform the grocery delivery industry through its innovative business model. He dropped out of college because he knew advanced technology paired with innovation could address critical issues in the real world.\n\n[S11] Zepto: How Two 17-Year-Olds Built India's Largest Seller Of Fruits and Vegetables\nURL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YKZCU0ynEbs&vl=en-US\n### Description\n230,356 views\nPosted: 2026-05-19\nAadit Palicha is the co-founder and CEO of Zepto, one of India's largest quick-commerce grocery platforms. What began as a WhatsApp group delivering groceries to neighbors in Mumbai during COVID has grown into a company employing over 200,000 people, processing millions of deliveries per day and operating one of India's largest fruits and vegetables supply chains — all built around a 10-minute delivery model powered by a network of dark stores. [...] [27:28] surrounded us that we've learned from and most of them most of that learning has come from our management team. So I think what the the luckiest that we've\n[27:36] been is that we've been able to find a team whether it's our CFO, our chief operating officer you met today, our CTO, you know, our head of growth and\n[27:44] marketing, our chief business officer, our, you know, leader in the product function. All of these people who've got decades of experience but are still [...] [25:40] Yeah, we've got about 500 or so engineers and another 150 people on data science, analytics, uh product management, designers, etc.\n[25:51] So, you know, we're very much hiring and, you know, actively in the market always for the best talent. So, if\n[25:58] anyone here is is keen, let us know. You know, we're still very much at the beginning of the journey. We consider ourselves an early stage startup. So,\n\n[S12] Previously learned\nURL: https://multiples.vc/private-comps/zepto\nPreviously learned from this page (2026-09-26):\n- Zepto: Raised $665 million in June 2024 co-led by Glade Brook Capital Partners, Nexus Venture Partners, and StepStone Group\n- Zepto: Secured $340 million in August 2024 led by General Catalyst and Mars Growth Capital\n\n[S13] Previously learned\nURL: https://entrackr.com/news/zepto-raises-350-mn-surpasses-135-bn-in-funding-for-2024-7599303\nPreviously learned from this page (2026-09-26):\n- Zepto: Raised $350 million in November 2024 led by Motilal Oswal Private Wealth",{"json":true,"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"answer":{"type":"string"},"claims":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"text":{"type":"string"},"citedUrl":{"type":"string"},"supportingUrls":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["text","citedUrl","supportingUrls"]}},"entitiesLearned":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"type":{"type":"string"},"facts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"fact":{"type":"string"},"sourceUrl":{"type":"string"}},"required":["fact","sourceUrl"]}}},"required":["name","type","facts"]}},"unableToFind":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["answer","claims","entitiesLearned","unableToFind"]}}]}
