Inc employed 16,08,000 people in\n\n[S15] Top Retail Companies in NYC, NY 2026 | Built In NYC\nURL: https://www.builtinnyc.com/companies/type/retail-companies\nStrategic Partnerships:\nPartnerships with Hy‑Vee, Giant Eagle, The Raley’s Companies, and expansions with Wakefern/ShopRite and Southeastern Grocers signal widening retailer adoption and geographic reach. Programmatic availability via platforms like Place Exchange and Vistar supports scaled, data‑driven activation across partners. [...] ## Celerant Tech\n\nCelerant is a leading provider of innovative end-to-end retail commerce software that maximizes business growth and efficiency for startup to enterprise businesses. We supplement the power and simplicity of our retail commerce software for in-store and eCommerce with an experienced team, online marketing services, industry-specific functionalities and features, and flexible pricing models to enable retailers to focus on their business,... [...] ## Draper James\n\nDraper James is a lifestyle brand founded by Reese Witherspoon. We are a fast-growing omnichannel startup focusing on southern-inspired women’s apparel, accessories and home goods. Our team is headquartered in New York City. Learn more at draperjames.com.\n\nDraper James\nCargo\n\n## Cargo\n\nBringing retail to rideshare and creating a modern, connected in-car experience.\n\nCargo\nHollister Co.\n\n## Hollister Co.",{"json":true,"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"answer":{"type":"string"},"claims":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"text":{"type":"string"},"citedUrl":{"type":"string"},"supportingUrls":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["text","citedUrl","supportingUrls"]}},"entitiesLearned":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"type":{"type":"string"},"facts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"fact":{"type":"string"},"sourceUrl":{"type":"string"}},"required":["fact","sourceUrl"]}}},"requi