, 2029, subject to the approval of the members of the Company. His present tenure as Whole Time Director will conclude on June [...] Ramesh 1 Reason for change, viz. Change in Designation Re-appointment of Mr. T.K. Ramesh as Whole Time Director of the Company. 2 Date of Appointment and term of appointment Date of Re-appointment: June 20, 2024 Re-appointment as Whole Time Director from June 20, 2024 to June 19, 2029, subject to the approval of the members of the Company. His present tenure as Whole Time Director will conclude on June 19, 2024. 3 Brief profile He has completed his master’s degree in commerce at Karnata\n\n[S3] RETNAVILASAM GOPINATHAN NAIR JISHNU\nURL: https://www.kalyanjewellers.net/images/investors-new/pdf/quarterly-results/FY%202023-2024/Earnings%20Call%20Transcript%202024/Earnings%20Call%20Transcripts%20q2.pdf\nincluded / omitted due to human error while transcribing the conference call. Any and all information should be verified with the company by the reader MANAGEMENT: MR. RAMESH KALYANARAMAN – EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR, KALYAN JEWELLERS INDIA LIMITED MR. SANJAY RAGHURAMAN – CEO, KALYAN JEWELLERS INDIA LIMITED MR. V. SWAMINATHAN – CFO, KALYAN JEWELLERS INDIA LIMITED MR. SANJAY MEHROTRA – HEAD OF STRATEGY & CORPORATE AFFAIRS, KALYAN JEWELLERS INDIA LIMITED Kalyan Jewellers India Limited November 16, 2023 [...] I will now hand the conference over to Mr. Rahul Agarwal. Thank you, and over to you, sir. Rahul Agarwal: Thank you. Good morning, everyone and thank you for joining us on Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Q2 FY24 Earnings Conference Call. We have with us Mr. Ramesh Kalyanaraman – Executive Director, Mr. Sanjay Raghuraman – CEO, Mr. V. Swaminathan – CFO, Mr. Sanjay Mehrotra – Head of Strategy and Corporate Affairs, and Mr. Abraham George – Head of Investor Relations and Treasury. I hope everyone [...] India Limited November 16, 2023 Page 18 of 18 Ramesh Kalyanaraman: Yes, no major change. Basically, the salary cost will keep on moving up because the staffs are on our books, and it has to go up. Otherwise, it should remain, meaning the usual what you call the 5%-6% expenses growth will be there. Otherwise, it should remain constant. Moderator: Thank you very much. As there are no further questions, I will now hand the conference over to the management for closing comments. Ramesh\n\n[S4] Kalyan Jewellers\nURL: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kalyan_Jewellers\n4. ↑ \"Kalyan Jewellers IPO opens today: Everything you need to know\". The Indian Express. 16 March 2021. Retrieved 1 October 2024.\n5. ↑ Stock exchange, Bombay. \"Kalyan Jewellers IPO BSE\" – via BSE Official.\n6. ↑ \"Ex-CAG Vinod Rai appointed as Kalyan Jewellers India chairman\". Business Today. 28 March 2022. Retrieved 1 October 2024.\n7. ↑ \"Kalyan Jewellers acquires remaining 15% stake in Candere for Rs 42 crore - CNBC TV18\". CNBCTV18. 3 June 2024. Retrieved 1 October 2024. [...] |  v  t  e  Thrissur | [...] In 2022, the company onboarded Vinod Rai as its chairperson and independent non-executive director. Vinod Rai was the former Comptroller and Auditor General of India (CAG) and the former chair of the United Nations Panel of External Auditors.\n\n## Candere\n\n[edit]\n\n[S5] Board Of Directors\nURL: https://www.kalyanjewellers.net/board-of-directors.php\nVinod Rai was the former comptroller and auditor general of India\n\nMr. Rai was awarded the Padma Bhushan, India’s Third highest civilian award in recognition of his services to the country.\n\nMr. TS Kalyanaraman\n\n###### Mr. TS Kalyanaraman\n\nManaging Director\n\n46 years’ retail experience\n\n26 years in the jewellery industry\n\nWith Kalyan since Inception\n\nMr.TK Seetharam\n\n###### Mr. TK Seetharam\n\nWhole Time Director\n\n23 Years with Kalyan\n\nMr.TK Ramesh\n\n###### Mr. TK Ramesh\n\nWhole Time Director [...] Kalyan Jewellers\n\n Don't miss these dazzling\n Sign up and Play\n Essentials for your everyday -\n\n STORE LOCATOR\n Feedback\n Contact\n\n My Kalyan\n Media\n Kalyan News\n GOLD RATES\n Digital Gold\n\ngold ring for men Kalyan Jewellers\n\n Home\n About Us\n Board Of Directors\n\n# Board Of Directors\n\n#### Board of directors enriching Kalyan with their Expertise and Insight\n\nMr. Vinod Rai\n\n###### Mr. Vinod Rai\n\nChairman & Independent Non-Executive Director [...] 23 Years with Kalyan\n\n#### Non – Executive Directors: Retail industry experience and financial sponsor Representations\n\nMr. Salil Nair\n\n###### Mr. Salil Nair\n\nNon-Executive Director\n\n24 years’ experience in the retail industry\n\nFormer CEO of Shoppers Stop.\n\nAnish Kumar Saraf\n\n###### Mr. Anish Kumar Saraf\n\nNon-Executive Director\n\nHigh dell Nominee Director\n\nManaging Director at Warburg Pincus, India\n\n#### Independent Directors: Industrial Experience and expertise in key domains\n\n[S6] Kalyan Jewellers to enter U.S. market in FY25 - The Hindu\nURL: https://www.thehindu.com/business/Industry/kalyan-jewellers-to-foray-into-us-market-in-fy25/article68003323.ece\n, we plan to open at least 80 Kalyan Jewellers showroom in India, at least 50 Candere stores in India and six showrooms overseas,” said Ramesh Kalyanaraman, Executive Director, Kalyan Jewellers India in an interview.\n\n“In FY26 we plan grow 20% more,” he added.\n\nIn the past year, the company had gone for the Franchise Owned Company Operated (FOCO) model and it would take this route to expand its base. [...] “So our expansion is completely fuelled by franchisee partners now. They will invest the money for the inventory and the capex for a store, and Kalyan Jewellers will run the store for them and it’s a margin share, which we do, wherein they get return on investment which they expect and we get the return which we want,” Mr. Kalyanaraman said. [...] He attributed growth in jewellery sales to the sector’s transition to becoming more formalised and the government mandating hallmarking and levying Goods & Services Tax.\n\nPublished - March 28, 2024 10:12 pm IST\n\n Copy link\n Email\n Facebook\n Twitter\n Telegram\n LinkedIn\n WhatsApp\n Reddit\n\nSEE ALL  Remove\n\n### Related Topics\n\njewelry\n\n0 / 0\n\nThe Hindu\n\nSign in to unlock member-only benefits!\n\n[S7] About Kalyan Jewellers - Company Information, ...\nURL: https://trendlyne.com/equity/about/447071/KALYANKJIL/kalyan-jewellers-india-ltd\nReferences\n\n1. Annual Report May 2025\n2. Investor Presentation Feb 2026\n3. Annual Report May 2024\n4. Investor Presentation Nov 2025\n\n## Kalyan Jewellers Management structure\n\nAll Gross Remunerations are in INR\n\n##### Jishnu R G\n\n###### Company Secretary, Compliance Officer\n\n-\n\nMar 26\n\nGross Remuneration\n\nYear\n\n##### Mr. Sanjay Raghuraman\n\n###### Chief Executive Officer\n\n-\n\nMar 26\n\nGross Remuneration\n\nYear\n\n##### Mr. V Swaminathan\n\n###### Chief Financial Officer\n\n-\n\nMar 26\n\nGross Remuneration [...] Gross Remuneration\n\nYear\n\n##### Mr. Arun Sankar\n\n###### Head(Technology)\n\n-\n\nMar 26\n\nGross Remuneration\n\nYear\n\n##### Mr. Sanjay Mehrottra\n\n###### Head(Strategy, Corporate Affairs)\n\n-\n\nMar 26\n\nGross Remuneration\n\nYear\n\n##### Mr. Abraham George\n\n###### Head(Treasury & Investor Relation)\n\n-\n\nMar 26\n\nGross Remuneration\n\nYear\n\n## Kalyan Jewellers Board of directors\n\nAll Gross Remunerations are in INR\n\n##### Trikkur Sitarama Iyer Kalyanaraman\n\n###### ED / MD / Promoter\n\n1127.6 Lac\n\n2025 [...] 1127.6 Lac\n\n2025\n\nGross Remuneration\n\nYear\n\n##### SEETHARAM KALYANARAMAN TRIKKUR\n\n###### WTD & Executive Director\n\n1127.6 Lac\n\n2025\n\nGross Remuneration\n\nYear\n\n##### TRIKKUR KALYANARAMAN RAMESH\n\n###### WTD & Executive Director\n\n1127.6 Lac\n\n2025\n\nGross Remuneration\n\nYear\n\n##### Vinod Rai\n\n###### Chairman & Independent Directo\n\n6 Lac\n\n2025\n\nGross Remuneration\n\nYear\n\n##### K J Udeshi\n\n###### Independent Non Exe. Director\n\n6 Lac\n\n2025\n\nGross Remuneration\n\nYear\n\n##### A D Murthy Chavali\n\n[S8] Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Management Team | Org Chart\nURL: https://rocketreach.co/kalyan-jewellers-india-limited-management_b5ed59e9f42e7e6a\nKalyan Jewellers India Limited employs 4,234 employees. The Kalyan Jewellers India Limited management team includes Sanjay Raghuraman (Chief Executive Officer), Sree Kuttan (Head of Human Resources), and Sourabh Yadav (Director Of Sales Marketing).\n\n## Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Org Chart\n\nImage 6: Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Employee Jose Livins's profile photo\n\nSanjay Raghuraman Chief Executive Officer\n\n2 \n\n6 \n\nHR (12)\") [...] Find Info \n\n## Top Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Management Employees\n\n   \nImage 9: Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Employee Sanjay Raghuraman's profile photo ### Sanjay Raghuraman #### Chief Executive Officer at Kalyan Jewellers India Limited India   View \n\n2\n       hotmail.com\n       kalyanjewellers.net\n\n5+\n       +91 85940 0XXXX\n       +91 487 243 XXXX\n       +91 487 243 XXXX\n       +91 99893 3XXXX\n       +91 94463 0XXXX\n       +91 40 3092 XXXX [...] Image 11: Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Employee Sajeev Chemmany's profile photo ### Sourabh Yadav #### Director Of Sales Marketing at Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Indore, MP, IN   View   \n   Image 12: Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Employee Siddartha Palu's profile photo ### Siddartha Palu #### Chief Financial Officer at Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Hyderabad, IN   View\n\n[S9] Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Marketing Department | Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Marketing Team\nURL: https://rocketreach.co/kalyan-jewellers-india-limited-marketing-department_b5ed59e9f42e7e6a\nImage 16: Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Employee Ranjit Singh's profile photo  Anirudh Karande Sales Marketing Executive  \n   Image 17: Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Employee Ritesh Shah's profile photo  Archi Saxena Associate Brand Manager  \n   Image 18: Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Employee Trupti Morone's profile photo  Neer Chandel Marketing Executive [...] Image 7: Vinod Vandayar's profile photo  Vinod Vandayar Marketing Executive  \n   Image 8: Trupti Morone's profile photo  Trupti Morone Senior Manager - Digital11  \n   Image 9: Vandhana V's profile photo  Surya Pandey Marketing Executive  \n   Image 10: Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Employee Trupti Morone's profile photo  Vijay Wilson Associate Brand Manager1  \n   Image 11: Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Employee Trupti Morone's profile photo  Ashok Arulmozhiselvam Marketing Executive [...] Image 12: Vandhana V's profile photo  Ivan Jacob Search Engine Optimization Specialist  \n   Image 13: Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Employee Ritesh Shah's profile photo  Arjun Anil Marketing Manager  \n   Image 14: Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Employee Ritesh Shah's profile photo  Sathya S Brand Executive1  \n   Image 15: Vandhana V's profile photo  Vandhana V Marketing Intern\n\n[S10] Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Competitors | Companies like Kalyan Jewellers India Limited\nURL: https://rocketreach.co/kalyan-jewellers-india-limited-competitors_b5ed59e9f42e7e6a\nTitle: Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Competitors | Companies like Kalyan Jewellers India Limited\nImage 5: Kalyan Jewellers India Limited. # Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Competitors. View More Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Competitors. View Kalyan Jewellers India Limited's top competitors like Amrapali Jewels, CKC Restaurants And Caterers, and Hira Panna Jewellers - India. Image 6: Senco Gold and Diamonds. Senco Gold and Diamonds See All Employees. With over 200 stores across India, the brand specializes in crafting exquisite designs in gold, diamonds, platinum, and silver. Our foundation is built on trust, transparency, and unwavering integrity, earning us the prestigious title of the second most trusted brand in India for four consecutive years, as recognized by the Trusted Research Advisory of India. Diversity is at the core of our identity, as we cater to the multifaceted cultures of India, which has honed our ability to understand and adapt to global preferences. We take pride in bringing the artistry of India to the world, creating jewellery that resonates with the essence of local tastes and traditions. At Senco Gold and Diamonds, we combine a rich legacy with contemporary excellence, offering jewellery that embodies the spirit of India's diverse heritage while upholding the highest standards of craftsmanship and customer trust. ## Top **Kalyan Jewellers India Limited** Employees. Image 9: Kalyan Jewellers India Limited Employee Kuldeep Gurjar's profile photo ### Sa\n\n[S11] Previously learned\nURL: https://images.assettype.com/bloombergquint/2024-06/ccf461f1-7931-43a1-bd39-7618c2b4aed6/Motilal_Oswal_Jewlery_Thematic_Note.pdf\nPreviously learned from this page (2026-09-26):\n- Kalyan Jewellers: Is one of the largest jewelry retail chains in India with over 217 stores initially and expanded to 76 franchise stores by FY24\n- Kalyan Jewellers: Has a Middle East business consisting of 36 stores as of FY24\n\n[S12] Previously learned\nURL: https://www.imarcgroup.com/india-jewellery-market\nPreviously learned from this page (2026-09-26):\n- Kalyan Jewellers: Announced plans in 2025 to open around 170 new stores through a franchise-led model in India and overseas",{"json":true,"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"answer":{"type":"string"},"claims":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"text":{"type":"string"},"citedUrl":{"type":"string"},"supportingUrls":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["text","citedUrl","supportingUrls"]}},"entitiesLearned":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"type":{"type":"string"},"facts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"fact":{"type":"string"},"sourceUrl":{"type":"string"}},"required":["fact","sourceUrl"]}}},"required":["name","type","facts"]}},"unableToFind":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["answer","claims","entitiesLearned","unab