roperly.","score":0.8245895},{"title":"[PDF] INVESTOR PRESENTATION - Kalyan Jewellers","url":"https://www.kalyanjewellers.net/images/Corporate%20Presentation.pdf","content":"look forward to my association with Kalyan.\" Note: Subject to regulatory and shareholder approval KALYAN JEWELLERS INDIA LIMITED 25 Professional Management Team Driving Business Growth & Expansion Management Team Mr. SANJAY RAGHURAMAN Chief Executive Officer • Qualified CA and CWA • 9+ years with Kalyan, 15 years prior experience in retail, financial services & operations • Previously worked with HDB Financial Services, Wipro and Clix Capital Mr. SANJAY MEHROTTRA Head of Strategy and Corporate [...] built the highest levels of trust amongst its stakeholders, conducts its business in an ethical and transparent manner and upholds the standards of good corporate governance. Kalyan Jewellers has a well-recognized brand, pan-India footprint and a strong management team at the helm of the business. The Kalyanaraman family, with its deep commitment to customer transparency and enlightenment, has been at the forefront of transforming the jewellery retailing sector in India. I eagerly look forward [...] and Corporate Affairs • Masters in Management Studies • 3+ years with Kalyan • ~27 years experience in Indian capital markets Mr. RAJESH R Head of Legal and Compliance • Bachelor of law and enrolled with Bar Council of Kerala • ~2 year with Kalyan • ~14 years experience in legal industry Mr. V. SWAMINATHAN Chief Financial Officer • Bachelor in Science from University of Madras, CA • 5+ years with Kalyan • 27 years experience in finance, corporate planning & control Mr. ABRAHAM GEORGE Head of","score":0.8215175},{"title":"Kalyan Jewellers India Limited (KALYANKJIL.NS) Company Profile & Facts - Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/KALYANKJIL.NS/profile","content":"| Name | Title | Pay | Exercised | Year Born |\n ---  --- \n| Mr. Sanjay Raghuraman | Chief Executive Officer | 21.27M  -- |\n| Mr. Seetharama Iyer Thrikur Kalyanaraman | Founder, MD & Executive Director | 111.74M  1947 |\n| Mr. V. Swaminathan | Chief Financial Officer | 20.07M  1959 |\n| Mr. Jishnu Retnavilasam Gopinathan Nair | Company Secretary & Compliance Officer | 3.53M  -- |\n| Mr. Ramesh Trikkur Kalyanaraman | Whole-Time Director | 111.74M  1975 | [...] Kalyan Jewellers India Limited, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the manufacture and retail of various gold and precious stone studded jewelry products in India, the Middle East, the United states of America, and United Kingdom, and internationally. It offers gold, diamond, silver, platinum, gemstone, and white and rose gold jewelry, including wedding, staple regional, aspirational, studded, and other jewelries. The company also provides chains, necklaces, bangles, bracelets, nose [...] bracelets, nose studs, choker, jewelry, and moti sets, daily wear, vaddanam, rings, earrings, pendants, anklets, pearls, studs, jhumka, lockets, harams, kadas, payals, and second studs. It offers its products under MUDHRA, NIMAH, ANOKHI, RANG, TEJASVI, ZIAH, LAYA, GLO, CANDERE, VEDHA, APOORVA, HERA, and MUHURAT brand names. Further, it sells its products through an online platform, candere.com. Kalyan Jewellers India Limited was founded in 1993 and is headquartered in Thrissur, India.","score":0.7522497},{"title":"Sanjay Raghuraman","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/in/sanjay-raghuraman-b89b59","content":"- “We have witnessed a renewed interest in gold from younger, first time customers, who are looking at convenient and easy means of purchasing the yellow metal. The introduction of digital gold will provide a holistic ecosystem for consumers.”, said Ramesh Kalyanaraman, Executive Director, Kalyan Jewellers. Click here to read more:  #KalyanJewellers ...more ...more  \nSanjay Raghuraman shared this  \nView Post  \nActivity Image [...] - \"We decided to make a foray into the franchise model to accelerate our expansion. Our initial plan to enter the franchise model of expansion was from 2025.However, looking at the kind of momentum and accelerated demand that we saw for the past 3-4 quarters, we have decided to enter into this model of expansion with a pilot of 2-3 stores in the first half of next fiscal,\" said Ramesh Kalyanaraman, Executive Director, Kalyan Jewellers Read more -  Business Standard #KalyanJewellers ...more [...] ...more ...more","score":0.6711479}]}
{"ts":"2026-09-26T17:01:30.578Z","session":"bc5ed9c3-17eb-4e53-a2e2-d55c2f33d937","event":"tool.end","callId":"dc3fdf7d-0384-4715-8302-e6fa18111d4c","name":"webSearch","duration_ms":3187,"result":[{"title":"VMware’s New CEO Raghu Raghuram: 8 Big Things To Know | CRN","url":"https://www.crn.com/slide-shows/virtualization/vmware-s-new-ceo-raghu-raghuram-8-big-things-to-know","content":"“I extend my warm congratulations to Raghu on his promotion to CEO and know he will take the company to new heights,” said Poonen in a statement. “I will be cheering on the company’s success, as I embark on my next adventure.”​\n\nRaghuram Will Change VMware Into A SaaS Company\n\nRaghuram has served as VMware’s chief operating officer of Products and Cloud Services since 2016, guiding VMware’s cloud and software-as-a-service (SaaS) transformation efforts. [...] Poonen, VMware’s global chief operating officer, customer operations, has made the personal decision to leave VMware after nearly eight years at the company. He oversaw all of VMware’s sales and customer operations, and was typically front-and-center during VMware’s biggest conferences.\n\nMany thought either Poonen or Raghuram would be named VMware’s new CEO if the company hired internally for the position. However, with Raghuram being selected, Poonen announced he would be leaving the company. [...] # VMware’s New CEO Raghu Raghuram: 8 Big Things To Know\n\nFrom Raghu Raghuram new salary to his rich history at the company, here’s eight big things you should know about VMware’s new CEO.\n\nRaghu Raghuram’s Salary, History And Vision For VMware\n\nVMware has selected its longtime technologist and cloud leader Raghu Raghuram as its new CEO replacing former CEO Pat Gelsinger who left this year to head Intel.","score":0.46672463},{"title":"VMware Names Company Veteran Raghu Raghuram Its Next CEO","url":"https://www.datacenterknowledge.com/next-gen-data-centers/vmware-names-company-veteran-raghu-raghuram-its-next-ceo","content":"“I extend my warm congratulations to Raghu on his promotion to CEO and know he will take the company to new heights,” Poonen said in a statement. “I will be cheering on the company’s success, as I embark on my next adventure.” [...] Raghuram came to VMware as director of product management in 2003 and rose through the ranks to his current position as COO of products and cloud services. Poonen joined the company a decade later than Raghuram did, after seven years at SAP, including about four as president and corporate officer. [...] # VMware Names Company Veteran Raghu Raghuram Its Next CEO\n\nSanjay Poonen, who was reportedly vying for the job, is leaving the company.\n\nVMware’s board has chosen the company’s next CEO. It will be Raghu Raghuram, currently an executive VP and COO at the data center software powerhouse.","score":0.44680908},{"title":"Raghu Raghuram to Become VMware CEO in June - GovCon Wire","url":"https://www.govconwire.com/articles/raghu-raghuram-to-become-vmware-ceo-in-june","content":"+ Executive Mosaic\n  + POC\n  + Executive Biz\n  + Executive Gov\n  + GovConExec\n  + Submit your news\n\n Friday, September 25, 2026\n\n GovCon Wire\n\n  Your Direct Source for Government Contracting News\n\nRaghu Raghuram to Become VMware CEO in June\n\nHome Executive Moves Raghu Raghuram to Become VMware CEO in June\n\n# Raghu Raghuram to Become VMware CEO in June\n\n Jane Edwards\n May 13, 2021\n Executive Moves,News\n\nAuthor: Jane Edwards || Date Published: May 13, 2021 [...] Raghuram currently serves as VMware’s executive vice president and chief operating officer for products and cloud services. He is a strategic business leader and has helped build up the company’s virtualization business, offered guidance to cloud business and software as a service transformation efforts and provided oversight to the company’s merger and acquisition and software-defined data center strategies. [...] Raghu Raghuram, who has been with VMware (NYSE: VMW) since 2003, has been elected by the board of directors to serve as CEO and board member of the Palo Alto, California-based technology company, effective June 1.\n\n“Raghu is now in position to architect VMware’s future, helping customers and partners accelerate their digital businesses in this multi-cloud world,” Michael Dell, board chairman at VMware, said in a statement published Wednesday.","score":0.41236505},{"title":"Rangarajan (Raghu) Raghuram - Indiaspora","url":"https://indiaspora.org/members/rangarajan-raghu-raghuram","content":"Rangarajan (Raghu) Raghuram\n\n# Rangarajan (Raghu) Raghuram\n\nChief Executive Officer at VMware\n\nRangarajan (Raghu) Raghuram is the Chief Executive Officer of VMware Inc. He earned his M.Tech. in Electrical Engineering from IIT Bombay in 1986 and an MBA from the Wharton School, University of Pennsylvania, in 1996. [...] Mr. Raghuram joined VMware in 2003, beginning his tenure by leading product management for ESX and vSphere. Over the years, he has held several key leadership positions, including Executive Vice President and General Manager of the Software-Defined Data Center division and Chief Operating Officer for Products and Cloud Services. In these roles, he was responsible for VMware’s overall product and service portfolio, as well as core support and operational functions. [...] An industry thought leader, Mr. Raghuram has played a pivotal role in VMware’s strategic and technological evolution, helping grow the company from a startup to a Fortune 200 enterprise. Under his leadership, VMware has reached approximately $13 billion in annual revenue, employs around 37,000 people, and serves over half a million customers across more than 100 countries. He has also overseen the development of VMware’s extensive technology portfolio, which includes more than 5,000 awarded","score":0.2736816},{"title":"VMware's new chapter: CEO Raghu Raghuram on multicloud, AI-driven strategy and the Broadcom acquisition - SiliconANGLE","url":"https://siliconangle.com/2023/08/22/vmwares-new-chapter-ceo-raghu-raghuram-multicloud-ai-driven-strategy-broadcom-acquisition-vmwareexplore","content":"Its historic run in shaping the technology landscape has been marked by bold pivots, remarkable resilience and an unwavering commitment to community and tech-savvy solutions. As the company enters a new era under the leadership of Chief Executive Officer Raghu Raghuram (pictured), it’s eyeing an artificial intelligence-driven future, with a focus on solving the multicloud challenges that enterprises face today. [...] Cornelis Networks raises $205M and scales up and out with its new Active Compute Fabric\n Dataminr puts real-time intelligence and agentic AI inside Crisis24 Horizon\n Copado extends Agentia agentic AI DevOps platform for Salesforce with headless automation\n Nvidia expands CUDA-Q platform to support fault-tolerant quantum processors\n Exclusive: 45Drives expands ransomware protection and adds multi-server management to its storage line","score":0.2735979}]}
