{"ts":"2026-09-26T17:03:38.578Z","session":"f222efe3-750b-436c-b711-11fce1f15687","event":"tool.end","callId":"15523322-929c-460b-a5fe-86909f4d83c6","name":"webSearch","duration_ms":2184,"result":[{"title":"From Software Engineer II to Engineering Manager","url":"https://blog.zepto.com/from-software-engineer-ii-to-engineering-manager-ravi-patels-journey-at-zepto-ed5e065fcdcc","content":"When Ravi Patel joined Zepto in 2021, he was one of the very first frontend engineers at a startup still defining its place in the quick commerce ecosystem. Fast forward to today — Ravi is an Engineering Manager leading the app teams responsible for Shopping experience, Super Saver, and New Category initiatives on Zepto’s consumer platform.\n\n## Get Bhavya Sharma’s stories in your inbox\n\nJoin Medium for free to get updates from this writer. [...] Sitemap\n\nOpen in app\n\nSign in\n\nSearch\n\nSign in\n\n## Zepto TechXPress\n\n·\n\nZepto TechXPress\n\nStories building the fastest growing company in India\n\n# From Software Engineer II to Engineering Manager — Ravi Patel's Journey at Zepto\n\nBhavya Sharma\n\nBhavya Sharma\n\n3 min read\n\n·\n\nJul 4, 2025\n\n--\n\nPress enter or click to view image in full size [...] > I joined as a full-stack developer, initially helping set up the web team while contributing to app initiatives. Over time, I’ve grown with the org and been promoted three times. I now lead a 10+ member frontend team focused on improving the shopping journey for millions of users.\n\n## 🧭 Why Zepto?\n\nWhat led you to join Zepto in the first place?","score":0.7515939},{"title":"Software Engineers (Front-end & Back-end roles) at Zepto","url":"https://startup.jobs/software-engineers-front-end-back-end-roles-zepto-8800811","content":"Join a Talented Team: Work with world-class talent and leaders who support career growth\n   Flexible Work: A remote-first work culture, with the opportunity to work anywhere in Australia. You’ll also get access to premium co-working spaces and a Byron, Sydney & Melbourne Hub\n   Paid Parental Leave: 12 weeks Paid Parental Leave for primary caregivers and 4 weeks for secondary caregivers [...] Why Zepto?\n\nHeadquartered in beautiful Byron Bay, Zepto has an inspiring founder story and is a customer-focused, culture-first organisation. You’ll be joining a team that champions curiosity and a pioneering perspective, and thrives in a fast-moving sector.\n\nJust some of Zepto’s commitments to our people include: [...] About the Role\n\nZepto’s engineering teams are growing! And we’re currently looking to hire a back-end and a front-end focused Software Engineer. Reporting into an Engineering Manager, these two roles will make a significant impact as we continue scaling a world-class payments platform.","score":0.46526662},{"title":"Zepto Career Growth & Development 2026 | Built In","url":"https://builtin.com/company/zepto/faq/career-growth-development","content":"Rapid Shift-in-Charge Path — Rider partners (“Zeptons”) are promoted to shift-in-charge within three to four months, with internal moves also into in-store operations and rider call-center support. Visible fast promotions and multi-track mobility increase retention and signal real, near-term leadership opportunities for high performers. [...] View Website\n\n Overview\n Jobs\n Offices\n + Working at Zepto\n  + Culture & Values\n  + Career Growth & Development\n  + Compensation & Benefits\n  + Work-Life Balance & Wellbeing\n  + Leadership & Management\n  + Stability & Growth\n Is This Your Company?  Claim Profile\n\n# Zepto Career Growth & Development\n\nUpdated on April 01, 2026 [...] Pragati Six-Month Mentorship — The Pragati program provides six months of mentoring and observation for graduate-level Zeptons before elevation to bigger roles from the rider level. This structured cadence makes advancement predictable and merit-based, helping early-career employees convert frontline experience into supervisory scope quickly.","score":0.43496582},{"t