ane working hours” as a factor that contributed to them finally quitting. But there were other things as well:\n\n The business struggling for growth\n Their equity grant’s value shrinking to nothing before their eyes\n CEO/founder ignoring or overriding efforts to help the business succeed","score":0.06650261}]}
{"ts":"2026-09-26T17:03:39.377Z","session":"f222efe3-750b-436c-b711-11fce1f15687","event":"tool.end","callId":"e625643a-2558-4fb1-8043-7c933d7f6b83","name":"webSearch","duration_ms":2986,"result":[{"title":"Zepto elevates Jitendra Singh to director of engineering - Indian Television Dot Com","url":"https://indiantelevision.com/mam/zepto-elevates-jitendra-singh-to-director-of-engineering","content":"Singh announced the development on LinkedIn, sharing that he has stepped into the new role after serving in a series of increasingly senior leadership positions at the company. As director of engineering, he will continue to oversee engineering excellence, platform scalability, product innovation and broader technology strategy as Zepto expands its footprint across India. [...] His appointment comes at a time when Zepto continues to scale operations in one of India’s most competitive consumer technology sectors. Engineering leadership has become increasingly critical for quick-commerce players as they balance rapid customer growth, operational efficiency and product innovation. [...] Share  Tweet\n\nMUMBAI: Climbing the tech ladder at quick speed, much like the deliveries his company is known for, Jitendra Singh has been promoted to director of engineering at Zepto, marking the latest milestone in his nearly four-year journey with the fast-growing quick-commerce platform.","score":0.8524574},{"title":"From Software Engineer II to Engineering Manager","url":"https://blog.zepto.com/from-software-engineer-ii-to-engineering-manager-ravi-patels-journey-at-zepto-ed5e065fcdcc","content":"When Ravi Patel joined Zepto in 2021, he was one of the very first frontend engineers at a startup still defining its place in the quick commerce ecosystem. Fast forward to today — Ravi is an Engineering Manager leading the app teams responsible for Shopping experience, Super Saver, and New Category initiatives on Zepto’s consumer platform.\n\n## Get Bhavya Sharma’s stories in your inbox\n\nJoin Medium for free to get updates from this writer. [...] From building the first version of the consumer web app to mentoring a growing team of developers, Ravi's story is a reflection of what it means to grow with Zepto: move fast, learn faster, and never lose sight of the customer.\n\n> Keep following the Zepto Tech Blog for more stories from the people powering the platform.\n\nZepto TechXPress\n\nZepto TechXPress\n\n## Published in Zepto TechXPress\n\n1.3K followers\n\n·Last published 5 days ago\n\nStories building the fastest growing company in India [...] Sitemap\n\nOpen in app\n\nSign in\n\nSearch\n\nSign in\n\n## Zepto TechXPress\n\n·\n\nZepto TechXPress\n\nStories building the fastest growing company in India\n\n# From Software Engineer II to Engineering Manager — Ravi Patel's Journey at Zepto\n\nBhavya Sharma\n\nBhavya Sharma\n\n3 min read\n\n·\n\nJul 4, 2025\n\n--\n\nPress enter or click to view image in full size","score":0.80014634},{"title":"Deepak Jain - Director of Engineering @ Zepto","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/in/deepcoder","content":"- One of the things I enjoy the most at Zepto is seeing complex systems take shape from a blank canvas. Over the last few years, we've built products at an incredible pace—not just shipping fast, but continuously evolving them to handle massive scale, changing business models, and ever-growing operational complexity. Every iteration teaches us something new. Our Builder Series is an opportunity to go beyond demos and feature launches. It's where our engineers share the architecture, trade-offs, [...] trade-offs, and engineering decisions behind the systems powering Zepto. These deep dives are so exciting and insightful. Looking forward to many more sessions from our teams! 🚀 Nikhil Mittal Ayush Agrawal Nishant Takkar Sripad Vallabha Sumit Nagariya Deepak Jain srk prasad Rajendra Bera ANUMOD AGARWAL Bhavya Sharma Pallavi M R [...] and a more productive engineering experience. Proud of the team's deep dive and the engineering mindset behind it. Kudos to Vivek Kumar , Madhavi Parmar and Sarthak J. ! 🚀 Zepto Deepak Jain Karthic Somalinga Nikhil Mittal Kaivalya V. #zepto #zeptotech","score":0.7610953},{"title":"Engineering Manager job at Zepto - Instahyre","url":"https://www.instahyre.com/job-219683-engineering-manager-at-zepto-bangalore","content":"Founded in 2021 by Aadit Palicha and Kaivalya Vohra, Zepto is on a mission to save you time making every second count towards life's real joys. Our platform has revolutionized rapid commerce in India with cutting-edge technology and strategically optimized delivery hubs. Zepto offers an extensive range of 45,000+ products, from fresh groceries to electronics, beauty essentials, apparels, toys and more, delivering across 50+ cities in minutes\\. Zepto Caf extends our commitment to convenience, [...] Engineering @ Zepto\n\nBuilding for scale, rapid iterative development, and customer-centric product thinking at each step define every day for a Zepto engineer. If building technology that impacts millions, brainstorming with some of the best minds in the country, executing at lightning speed, product-driven thinking, and owning your work from start to finish excites you, then Zepto is the right place for you.\n\nAbout Company\n\n##  Office and Product Photos [...] ## at Zepto Featured employer Diversity & inclusion focused employer\n\nBangalore8-13 Years\n\nThis job is no longer accepting applications\n\n## Job Description\n\nFunction:  Software Engineering → Mobile Development\n\n \n React Native\n JavaScript\n\n## About About Zepto\n\nOur Story","score":0.6615081},{"title":"Anshuman Srivastava - Engineering @ Zepto | Ex Gojek ...","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/in/justanshuman","content":"# Anshuman Srivastava\nZepto\nBengaluru, Karnataka, India, IN  \n500 connections, 4849 followers\n\n## About\nProduct Engineering Leader with experience in leading high performing cross functional…\n\n## Experience\nN/A\n\n## Education\n### ABV-Indian Institute of Information Technology and Management  \nN/A  \n2010 - 2015  \nNone\n\n## Publications\nN/A\n\n## Honors & Awards\nN/A\n\n## Certifications\nBuilding and Leading Effective Teams (Columbia Business School)\n\n## Volunteering\n- Mentor\nScaler Academy\nEducation\nN/A","score":0.61251885}]}
{"ts":"2026-09-26T17:03:41.192Z","session":"f222efe3-750b-436c-b711-11fce1f15687","event":"tool.end","callId":"f8ec7eeb-28aa-4505-ad75-f306785ff34a","name":"webSearch","duration_ms":4799,"result":[{"title":"Gen-Zs should stay focused on their goals and must give their best: Yash Dayal, Head of Engineering, Zepto | TechGig","url":"https://cio.techgig.com/my-first-tech-job/gen-zs-should-stay-focus-on-their-goals-and-must-give-their-best-yash-dayal-head-of-engineering-zepto/articleshow_b2b/99206539.cms","content":"* Gen-Zs should stay focused on their goals and must give their best: Yash Dayal, Head of Engineering, Zepto. # Gen-Zs should stay focused on their goals and must give their best: Yash Dayal, Head of Engineering, Zepto. In an exclusive interaction with Yash Dayal, Head of Engineering, Zepto his learnings and experience at his first job and as a Senior Vice President and CTO. We got an exclusive chance to interact with Yash Dayal, Head of Engineering, Zepto shared his learnings and experience at his first job and as a Senior Vice President and CTO. E-Commerce is a challenging space as successful companies need to be best-in-class across many dimensions like operations, customer care, etc. **TechGig: Can you tell us your exclusive learnings from your first tech job?**. **Yash:** Your first tech job needs to be as explorational as possible. **Yash:** Technology evolves at a very rapid pace and one needs to have a dedicated focus to remain updated with the latest innovations in the space. A lot of times, fundamentals and approaches which were industry standards get disrupted by technology and one needs to adapt to learning new ways of doing things. **Yash:** The world today is full of many distractions and it is easy to get influenced and pressured by social media and success stories. The flip side is that the new-gen working cultures, like the hybrid work model, come with a unique set of challenges. 28 Aug 2024, 01:28 PMTechGig Guest Author. 9 Aug 2024, 10:40 AMTechGig Guest Author. Next Story: **Follow a work discipline to be successful in career: Dr. Kiran Marri, SVP & Chief Scientist, Movate**. Next Story: **My mantra is to not lose sight of long-term work and life objectives: Ranga Shetty, General Manager, Granicus India**. Next Story: **My First Job: Deepak Visweswaraiah, VP - Platform Engineering, and Site Managing Director, Pegasystems, India**. Next Story: **First job experience of Raja Lakshmipathy, MD-India and SAARC, Genesys**. * 1Gen-Zs should stay focused on their goals and must give their best: Yash Dayal, Head of Engineering, Zepto. * 6My First Job: Deepak Visweswaraiah, VP - Platform Engineering, and Site Managing Director, Pegasystems, India.","score":0.7460839},{"title":"Zepto elevates Zepto Cafe's business head Shashank Shekhar Sharma as CXO | Company News - Business Standard","url":"https://www.business-standard.com/companies/news/zepto-elevates-zepto-cafe-s-business-head-shashank-shekhar-sharma-as-cxo-124121900993_1.html","content":"\"After 2 years of deep work, iteration, and disciplined scaling, Zepto Caf is now at 30K+ orders/day and what we believe to be clear customer product-market-fit and solid unit economics.\n\n \n\n\"This excellent execution was only possible because of the leadership of Shashank Shekhar Sharma, who worked tirelessly with his team to turn Zepto Caf from a fringe idea to what could be the next revolution in food QSR in India,\" Zepto co-founder and CEO Aadit Palicha said in a LinkedIn post on Thursday. [...] Sharma, who has been building Zepto Cafe since its inception, will oversee Caf operations, footprint expansion, equipment procurement, quality control, and the end-to-end customer experience of Zepto Caf, a company statement said.\n\nPreviously serving as Business Head at Zepto Cafe, Sharma will continue to report to Zepto President Vinay Dhanani. [...] Thursday, September 24, 2026 | 07:17 AM ISTहिंदी में पढें\n\nNotification Icon\n\nuserprofile IconSearch\n\nHome / Compan