newsDetail)[Interviews](https://hr.economictimes.indiatimes.com/tag/Interviews?utm_source=main_menu2&utm_medium=newsDetail)\n\n \n\n* [Integrated Campaigns](/brand-solutions/integrated-campaigns?utm_source=main_menu&utm_medium=newsDetail)\n* [Bespoke Events](/brand-solutions/bespoke-events?utm_source=main_menu&utm_medium=newsDetail)\n* [Advertorial](/brand-solutions/advertorial?utm_source=main_menu&utm_medium=newsDetail)\n* [Virtual Engagement](/brand-solutions/virtual-engagement?utm_source=main_menu&utm_medium=newsDetail)\n* [Videos](/brand-solutions/videos?utm_source=main_menu&utm_medium=newsDetail)\n* [Digital Branding & Awareness](/brand-solutions/digital-branding-and-awareness?utm_source=main_menu&utm_medium=newsDetail)\n* [More](javascript:void(0);)\n\n* [More](javascript:void(0);)\n\n* [Industry](/news/industry)\n* 1 min read\n\n# Wakefit.co appoints Yash Dayal as CTO\n\nPrior to joining Wakefit.co, Dayal was serving as the Head of Engineering at Zepto.\n\n![Online Desk](https://hr.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg)\n\n* Online Desk\n* [ETHRWorld](/agency/88675792/ETHRWorld)\n\n* Updated On Jul 13, 2023 at 05:41 PM IST\n\n* [![Google Preference icon](https://img.etb2bimg.com/files/cp/6e49a4e9b325074f01a6.png)](https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=et%20hrworld) \n\n  Select ETHRWorld as Preferred Choice on Google\n* + Copy Link\n  + Share on WhatsApp\n  + Share on Linkedin\n  + Share on X\n  + Share on Telegram\n  + Share on Facebook\n\n![](https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-share-arrow.png) ![](https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/bookmark-icon-grey.svg?mod=2) ![BookMark](https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/bookmarked-icon.svg) ![Comment](https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/comment-icon.svg?mod=3462)\n\n* ![Twitter](/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/twitter-share.svg?mod=2)\n* ![Whatsapp](/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/whatsapp-share.svg)\n* ![Linkedin](/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/linkedin-share.svg)\n* ![Telegram](/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/telegram-share.svg)\n* ![Facebook](/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/facebook-share.svg)\n* ![Copy Link](/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/copy-icon.svg)\n\n![<p>Yash Dayal, Chief Technology Officer, Wakefit.co</p>](/images/default.jpg)\n\nYash Dayal, Chief Technology Officer, Wakefit.co\n\n[Wakefit.co](/tag/wakefit.co), an Indian home and sleep solutions company, on Thursday announced the [appointment](/tag/appointment) of [Yash Dayal](/tag/yash+dayal) as its Chief Technology Officer.  \n  \nPrior to joining Wakefit.co, Dayal held key roles, including Head of Engineering at Zepto, [CTO](/tag/cto) at Zivame, and Senior Director at Myntra and Jabong. He has also served at [Yahoo](/tag/yahoo)! and [Info Edge India](/tag/info+edge+india) (naukri.com).  \n  \nIn his new role, Dayal will spearhead all technology initiatives, with a particular emphasis on the brand's ongoing omnichannel expansion. His pivotal role will further the technology vision of the brand, help create scalable tech products and also lead high-performing engineering and data science teams, according to a statement..  \n  \n\nAdvt\n\n[Chaitanya Ramalingegowda](/tag/chaitanya+ramalingegowda), Director and Co-Founder, Wakefit.co, said, “Yash's expertise will play a pivotal role in redefining our omnichannel experience and driving optimisations across logistics, customer experience, operations, demand generation, and other cogs of the organisational wheel.”  \n  \nYash Dayal, Chief Technology Officer, Wakefit.co, said, “As a market leader, Wakefit.co has the potential to set new standards in the industry, and I am committed to contributing to the company’s growth. With a focus on omnichannel expansion, my goal is to redefine the customer experience by leveraging advanced technology and data science.”  \n  \nWith a career spanning over two decades, Dayal holds a Master's degree from the [University of Texas](/tag/university+of+texas) at El Paso.\n\n* By Online Desk ,\n* [ETHRWorld](/agency/88675792/ETHRWorld)\n\n* Published On Jul 13, 2023 at 05:41 PM IST\n\n* See more on:\n* [info edge india](/tag/info+edge+india \"info edge india\"),\n* [chaitanya ramalingegowda](/tag/chaitanya+ramalingegowda \"chaitanya ramalingegowda\"),\n* [yahoo](/tag/yahoo \"yahoo\"),\n* [university of texas](/tag/university+of+texas \"university of texas\"),\n* [Wakefit.co](/tag/wakefit.co \"Wakefit.co\"),\n* [Yash Dayal](/tag/yash+dayal \"Yash Dayal\"),\n* [CTO](/tag/cto \"CTO\"),\n* [appointment](/tag/appointment \"appointment\"),\n* [CXO Movement](/tag/cxo+movement \"CXO Movement\")\n\n* + Telegram\n  + Facebook\n  + Copy Link\n\n## Comments\n\n![comment](https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/et-default-user_1.svg)\n\nWhat are your thoughts?\n\nComment Now Read Comment (1)\n\n## All Comments\n\nBy commenting, you agree to the [Prohibited Content Policy](https://hr.economictimes.indiatimes.com/terms_conditions.php#prohibited_cnt)\n\nPost\n\nBy commenting, you agree to the [Prohibited Content Policy](https://hr.economictimes.indiatimes.com/terms_conditions.php#prohibited_cnt)\n\nPost\n\n## Find this Comment Offensive?\n\nChoose your reason below and click on the submit button. This will alert our moderators to take actions\n\nREASONS FOR REPORTING\n\n## Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals.\n\n### Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights & analysis in your inbox.\n\n## All about ETHRWorld industry right on your smartphone!\n\n* [Download the ETHRWorld App](/app) and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.\n\n ![](https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/bar-codes/hr_barcode.png?mod=3462)\n\n* [Home](https://hr.economictimes.indiatimes.com)\n* [News](https://hr.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news)\n* [Industry](https://hr.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry)\n* Wakefit.co appoints Yash Dayal as CTO\n\"\"\"",{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"verdict":{"type":"string","format":"enum","enum":["supported","unsupported","contradicted"]},"evidenceQuote":{"type":"string"},"reasoning":{"type":"string"}},"required":["verdict","evidenceQuote","reasoning"]}}]}
