ncial year ended March 2026\n\n240K+\n\nEmployees\n\n65 Countries\n\nwith 146+ Nationalities\n\n80 years\n\nof progress & purpose\n\n25+ years\n\nlisted on NYSE\n\n66%\n\nEconomic interest vested in philanthropy\n\nWhat Drives Us.\n\nSPIRIT OF WIPRO\n\n[S16] News and Events - Wipro\nURL: https://www.wipro.com/newsroom\nMarch 19, 2026\n\nGANDHINAGAR, India – March 19, 2026: Wipro Limited (NYSE: WIT, BSE: 507685, NSE: WIPRO), a leading AI-powered technology services and consulting company, today announced the...\n\nRead more\n\n#### Wipro and Harness Announce Strategic Collaboration to Accelerate AI-Native Software Delivery for Global Enterprises\n\nMarch 17, 2026 [...] February 04, 2026\n\nBENGALURU, India | CAMBRIDGE, Mass. – Feb. 04, 2026: Wipro Limited (NYSE: WIT, BSE: 507685, NSE: WIPRO), a leading AI-powered technology services and consulting company,...\n\nRead more\n\n#### Wipro earthian Awards 2025 Felicitate Excellence in Sustainability Education\n\nJanuary 31, 2026\n\nBENGALURU, India – Jan. 31, 2026: Wipro Limited (NYSE: WIT, BSE: 507685, NSE: WIPRO), a leading AI-powered technology services and consulting company, today hosted the...\n\nRead more [...] April 01, 2026\n\nE. BRUNSWICK, N.J. | BENGALURU, India – April 1, 2026: Wipro Limited (NYSE: WIT, BSE: 507685, NSE: WIPRO), a leading AI powered technology services and...\n\nRead more\n\n#### Wipro Expands Strategic Presence in South Korea, Launches Innovation Lab in Seoul\n\nMarch 23, 2026\n\nThe expanded footprint and Innovation Lab in Seoul enhances the company’s ability to serve South Korean clients, and reinforce the country’s role as a strategic...\n\nRead more",{"json":true,"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"answer":{"type":"string"},"claims":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"text":{"type":"string"},"citedUrl":{"type":"string"},"supportingUrls":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["text","citedUrl","supportingUrls"]}},"entitiesLearned":{"type":"array",