{"ts":"2026-09-26T17:20:17.724Z","session":"ec2d1ae0-3acd-41d8-aab0-e4e32af0e533","event":"tool.end","callId":"5662d15a-4d18-4d02-b8f1-15780745f589","name":"webSearch","duration_ms":2478,"result":[{"title":"Srini Pallia – Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director of Wipro","url":"https://www.wipro.com/blogs/srini-pallia","content":"Srini Pallia is the Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director of Wipro Limited. In his role as the CEO, Srini sets the vision and strategy for Wipro’s business and leads a team of global leaders to drive consistent execution of Wipro’s AI-powered, consulting- led approach across six continents. [...] Prior to assuming the Global CEO role, Srini served as CEO of Wipro’s Americas 1 Strategic Market Unit (SMU), turning it into Wipro’s largest and fastest growing SMU. In his more than three decades at Wipro, Srini has held numerous leadership roles, including President of Wipro’s Consumer Business Unit and Global Head of Business Application Services. [...] Srini has a track record of building cross-functional, cross-regional teams that deliver on clients’ most complex business and digital transformation needs. His focus on client- centricity and ability to lead through major industry transformations have been instrumental in driving ongoing value for clients as well as consistent profitable growth for the businesses he has led.","score":0.96469927},{"title":"Srini Pallia - Agenda Contributor | World Economic Forum","url":"https://www.weforum.org/stories/authors/srini-pallia","content":"Srini Pallia is Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director of Wipro Limited, a $10.8 Billion global technology services and consulting company, with over 230,000 employees in six continents. Srini was appointed CEO in April 2024. [...] ## Srini Pallia\n\nChief Executive Officer and Managing Director, Wipro [...] Most recently, Srini served as CEO of Americas 1, Wipro’s largest and fastest growing strategic market. In this role, he led a wide range of industry sectors and was responsible for establishing their vision, as well as shaping and implementing growth strategies.","score":0.9615375},{"title":"Srini Pallia - Indiaspora","url":"https://indiaspora.org/business-leader/srini-pallia","content":"Srini Pallia\n\n# Srini Pallia\n\n### CEO, Wipro\n\n Residence: New Jersey\n HQ: India\n Net Income: $1.53 B\n Revenue: $ 10.41 B\n Market Cap: $32.7 B\n\n# Srini Pallia\n\n### CEO, Wipro\n\nSrini Pallia is the Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director of Wipro Limited, one of India’s leading global information technology, consulting, and business process services companies. He assumed this role in April 2024, marking a significant milestone in his three-decade career with the company. [...] have shaped his understanding of the global technology services industry.  As CEO and Managing Director, Pallia sets the vision and strategy for Wipro’s business, leading a team of global leaders to drive consistent execution of Wipro’s AI-powered, consulting-led approach across six key industry sectors. His leadership style emphasizes strengthening business performance while accelerating growth through innovation and strategic market positioning. [...] Born in 1967 and raised in India, Pallia earned his Master of Technology from the Indian Institute of Science (IISc) in Bangalore between 1990 and 1992. He is a distinguished alumnus of IISc, Harvard, and McGill University, having attended advanced leadership programs at these prestigious institutions.  Pallia joined Wipro in 1992, making him a true company veteran with over three decades of experience. Throughout his tenure, he has held numerous leadership positions that have shaped his","score":0.95857275},{"title":"Srini Pallia Leads Wipro Limited as CEO & MD","url":"https://www.wipro.com/leadership/srini-pallia","content":"popup-image\n\nSrini Palliais the Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director of Wipro Limited. In his role as the CEO, Srini sets the vision and strategy for Wipro’s business and leads a team of global leaders to drive consistent execution of Wipro’s AI-powered, consulting- led approach across six continents. [...] Prior to assuming the Global CEO role, Srini served as CEO of Wipro’s Americas 1 Strategic Market Unit (SMU), turning it into Wipro’s largest and fastest growing SMU. In his more than three decades at Wipro, Srini has held numerous leadership roles, including President of Wipro’s Consumer Business Unit and Global Head of Business Application Services. [...] Srini has a track record of building cross-functional, cross-regional teams that deliver on clients’ most complex business and digital transformation needs. His focus on client- centricity and ability to lead through major industry transformations have been instrumental in driving ongoing value for clients as well as consistent profitable growth for the businesses he has led.","score":0.9555894},{"title":"Wipro Appoints Srini Pallia as CEO & Managing Director","url":"https://www.wipro.com/newsroom/press-releases/2024/wipro-appoints-srini-pallia-as-ceo-and-managing-director","content":"EAST BRUNSWICK, N.J. | BENGALURU, India – April 6, 2024:  Wipro Limited (NYSE: WIT, BSE: 507685, NSE: WIPRO), a leading technology services and consulting company, today announced the appointment of Srini Pallia as the Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director of the Company, effective immediately. He succeeds Thierry Delaporte, who, after spearheading a significant transformation at Wipro for the last four years, is stepping down to pursue passions outside the workplace. [...] Srini joined Wipro in 1992 and has held many leadership positions, including President of Wipro’s Consumer Business Unit and Global head of Business Application Services. Srini brings to the CEO role extensive institutional and industry knowledge, as well as a strong track record of leadership through some of the most significant technological shifts the industry has seen. [...] “Srini is an ideal leader to lead Wipro at this pivotal moment for our company and industry. Over the past four years, Wipro has undergone a major transformation under the most challenging external conditions. Srini has been an integral part of this journey. His client-centric approach, growth mindset, strong execution focus, and his commitment to Wipro's values, make him the perfect fit as we enter the next chapter of growth and profitability,” said Rishad Premji, Chairman, Wipro Ltd.","score":0.95250803}]}
{"ts":"2026-09-26T17:20:18.041Z","session":"ec2d1ae0-3acd-41d8-aab0-e4e32af0e533","event":"tool.end","callId":"8a52bcc4-1d93-46e0-9532-bbc35fce30b2","name":"webSearch","duration_ms":2794,"result":[{"title":"Thierry Delaporte resigns as Wipro CEO; Srinivas Pallia named new Chief Executive Officer, ETTelecom","url":"https://telecom.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/enterprise-services/thierry-delaporte-resigns-as-wipro-ceo-srinivas-pallia-named-new-chief-executive-officer/109099633","content":"\"At their meeting held on April 6, 2024...pursuant to the recommendation of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee, the Board of Directors has approved the appointment of Srinivas Pallia as the Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director of the company with effect from April 7, 2024, for a period of five years, subject to the approval of shareholders and the Central Government as may be applicable,\" Wipro informed in an exchange filing. [...] New Delhi: Indian IT major Wipro on Saturday announced the resignation of Thierry Delaporte as CEO and named Srinivas Pallia as the new Chief Executive Officer of the company, effective immediately. The announcement comes days before the Bengaluru-headquartered company is scheduled to announce its Q4 and full-year earnings for 2023-24 on April 19. Wipro has been trailing its peers on the performance front with subdued report card and weak guidance and saw a spate of senior-level departures [...] In a release announcing the top-level changes, Wipro said the appointment of Pallia (a Wipro veteran) as the Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director, is \"effective immediately\" and that he will be based in New Jersey and report to Chairman Rishad Premji.","score":0.96136373},{"title":"6-K","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1123799/000119312524089612/d736872d6k.htm","content":"Officer and Managing Director, with effect from April 6, 2024. Mr. Delaporte will be relieved from the employment of the Company with effect from May 31, 2024. The Board of Directors of the Company has approved the appointment of\nSrinivas Pallia as its Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director, with effect from April 7, 2024 (the “Officer Transition”). A copy of the letter to the Exchanges concerning the Officer Transition is attached hereto as\nItem 99.1. [...] On April 6, 2024, the Company informed the securities\nexchanges in India on which its securities are listed and the New York Stock Exchange (together, the “Exchanges”) that the Board of Directors of the Company has noted the resignation of Thierry Delaporte as its Chief Executive [...] Wipro Limited, a company organized under the laws of the Republic of India (the “Company”), hereby furnishes the Commission\nwith the following information relating to the resignation of the Company’s Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director and the appointment of a new Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director. The following information shall not be deemed","score":0.95628047},{"title":"Appointment of Managing Director and Chief Executive Officer","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/appointment-managing-director-chief-executive-001000252.html","content":"|  |  |  |\n --- [...] 1. My Portfolio\n2. 1. Markets \n      1. Stock market\n      2. Crypto\n      3. Real estate\n      4. Magnificent 7\n      5. Private markets\n      6. Futures & Derivatives\n   2. Originals\n   3. Newsletters\n   4. Economy & Policy \n      1. Earnings\n      2. Oil & gas\n      3. Strait of Hormuz\n      4. Tariffs\n      5. Clean Energy\n   5. Tech \n      1. Aerospace & Defense\n      2. Enterprise Cloud\n      3. Pharma & Biotech\n      4. Cybersecurity\n   6. Exchange-Traded Funds\n3. 1. Stocks [...] 5. Insurance \n      1. Find car insurance\n      2. Types of car insurance\n      3. Find life insurance\n   6. Taxes \n      1. How to file\n      2. Tax brackets and rates\n      3. Child tax credit\n      4. Tax extension\n      5. Tax refund status\n   7. Student loans \n      1. Federal vs. private\n      2. How to apply\n      3. FAFSA 2026-27\n      4. Student loan assistance\n   8. Personal loans \n      1. Best personal loans\n      2. Improve credit score\n      3. How to get approved","score":0.64478505},{"title":"MANAGING DIRECTOR & CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER APPOINTMENT","url":"https://ca.finance.yahoo.com/news/managing-director-chief-executive-officer-233400132.html","content":"has contributed to the Company's many achievements during my tenure.\" [...] SOURCE Paladin Energy Ltd\n\nCision\n\nCision\n\n \n\nView original content to download multimedia: \n\nTerms  and Privacy Policy\n\nPrivacy Dashboard\n\n## Recommended Stories [...] 6. Currency Converter","score":0.54724693},{"title":"Appointment of Managing Director and Chief Executive Officer","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/appointment-managing-director-chief-executive-001000252.html?fr=sycsrp_catchall","content":"Title: Appointment of Managing Director and Chief Executive Officer\nSkip to navigation  Skip to right column. # Yahoo Finance. 3. Most active penny stocks. 2. Best 0% APR cards. 3. Best balance transfer cards. 2. Best high-yield savings accounts. 3. Best money market accounts. 4. Best free checking accounts. 2. Types of car insurance. 2. Tax brackets and rates. 3. How to get approved. 2. 50/30/20 Budget Calculator. 6. Asking for a Trend. This is a paid press release. Contact the press release distributor directly with any inquiries. # Appointment of Managing Director and Chief Executive Officer. Perth, WA, Oct. 01, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- perseus mining confirms appointment of new managing director and chief executive officer. Perseus Mining Limited (ASX/TSX:PRU) is pleased to announce that Mr Craig Jones has been appointed to the position of Managing Director and Chief Executive Officer (CEO) effective 1 October 2025. The appointment follows the retirement of former Managing Director and CEO, Mr Jeff Quartermaine, on 30 September 2025, and the period of leadership transition since Mr Jones commenced in the role of CEO-Designate on 18 August 2025. Reference is made to Perseus's market release dated 1 August 2025 containing details of Mr Jones's experience and remuneration package. **This market announcement was authorised for release by the Chairman of the Board of Perseus Mining Limited, Mr Rick Menell.**. | **ASX/TSX CODE: PRU**    **CAPITAL STRUCTURE:**  Ordinary shares: 1,351,166,409  Performance rights: 8,618,344  **REGISTERED OFFICE:**  Level 2  437 Roberts Road  Subiaco WA 6008  Telephone: +61 8 6144 1700  **www.perseusmining.com** | **DIRECTORS:**  Rick Menell  Non-Executive Chairman  Craig Jones  Managing Director & CEO   Amber Banfield Non-Executive Director  Elissa Cornelius  Non-Executive Director  Dan Lougher  Non-Executive Director  John McGloin  Non-Executive Director  James Rutherford Non-Executive Director | **CONTACTS:**  **Craig Jones**  *Managing Director & CEO*  craig.jones@perseusmining.com  **Stephen Forman**  *Investor Relations*  +61 484 036 681  stephen.forman@perseusmining.com  **Nathan Ryan**  *Media*  +61 420 582 887  nathan.ryan@nwrcommunications.com.au |. * 01102025\\_Market Update\\_Appointment of Managing Director. ## Recommended Stories.","score":0.04924507}]}
