{"ts":"2026-09-26T17:20:36.270Z","session":"13401fe8-664b-49ab-9131-21ab711420eb","event":"tool.end","callId":"4df54589-b3ea-471e-ad1a-f51220751eaf","name":"webSearch","duration_ms":2509,"result":[{"title":"Wipro","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wipro","content":"Wipro Limited (/ˈwɪproʊ/ ⓘ) is an Indian multinational technology company based in Bengaluru. It provides information technology, consulting and business process services, and is one of India's Big Six \"Big Tech (India)\") IT services companies. Wipro's services include cloud computing, computer security, digital transformation, artificial intelligence, robotics, data analytics, and other technologies.\n\n## History\n\n[edit]\n\n### Early years\n\n[edit] [...] [edit]\n\nThe company was incorporated on 29 December 1945 in Amalner by MH Hasham Premji as Western India Vegetable Products Limited, a manufacturer of cooking oils. In 1966, after Hasham Premji's death, his son Azim Premji took over as chairperson at age 21.\n\nThe company changed its name to Wipro Products Limited in 1977, followed by Wipro Limited, a syllabic abbreviation of the original name, in 1982.\n\n### Shift to IT\n\n[edit] [...] | Headquarters at Sarjapura Road, Bengaluru |\n| Trade name | Wipro |\n| Formerly | Western India Vegetable Products Limited (1945–1977)  Wipro Products Limited (1977–1982) |\n| Type | Public |\n| Traded as |  BSE: 507685  NSE: WIPRO  NYSE: WIT  NSE NIFTY 50 constituent |\n| ISIN | INE075A01022 |\n| Industry | Information technology Consulting Outsourcing |\n| Founded | 29 December 1945; 80 years ago (29 December 1945) |\n| Founder | MH Hasham Premji |\n| Headquarters | Bengaluru, Karnataka , India |","score":0.91306627},{"title":"Wipro","url":"https://linkedin.com/company/wipro","content":"Wipro Limited (NYSE: WIT, BSE: 507685, NSE: WIPRO) is a leading AI-powered technology services and consulting company focused on building innovative solutions that address clients’ most complex digital transformation needs. Leveraging our consulting-led approach and the Wipro Intelligence™ unified suite of AI-powered platforms, solutions and transformative offerings, we help clients realize their boldest ambitions to build intelligent and sustainable businesses. The Wipro Innovation Network – [...] Network – part of the Wipro Intelligence™ suite – underpins our commitment to client-centric co-innovation and co-creation by bringing together capabilities from the innovation labs and partner labs, academia, and global tech communities. With over 240,000 employees and business partners across 65 countries, we deliver on the promise of helping our customers, colleagues, and communities thrive in an ever-changing world. For additional information, visit us at www.wipro.com. [...] ### Website\n\n### Crunchbase\nN/A\n### LinkedIn\nN/A\n\n### Industry\nIT Services and IT Consulting\n\n### Company Size\n10,001+ employees  \n274859 associated members (LinkedIn members who've listed Wipro as their current workplace on their profile)\n\n### Founded\nN/A\n\n### Funding\nLast Round Date: N/A\nLast Round Type: N/A\nTotal Rounds: N/A\nLast Round Raised: N/A\n\n### Investors\nN/A","score":0.9108078},{"title":"Wipro","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/wipro","content":"Wipro Limited (NYSE: WIT, BSE: 507685, NSE: WIPRO) is a leading AI-powered technology services and consulting company focused on building innovative solutions that address clients’ most complex digital transformation needs. Leveraging our consulting-led approach and the Wipro Intelligence™ unified suite of AI-powered platforms, solutions and transformative offerings, we help clients realize their boldest ambitions to build intelligent and sustainable businesses. The Wipro Innovation Network – [...] Network – part of the Wipro Intelligence™ suite – underpins our commitment to client-centric co-innovation and co-creation by bringing together capabilities from the innovation labs and partner labs, academia, and global tech communities. With over 240,000 employees and business partners across 65 countries, we deliver on the promise of helping our customers, colleagues, and communities thrive in an ever-changing world. For additional information, visit us at www.wipro.com. [...] ### Website\n\n### Crunchbase\nN/A\n### LinkedIn\nN/A\n\n### Industry\nIT Services and IT Consulting\n\n### Company Size\n10,001+ employees  \n274859 associated members (LinkedIn members who've listed Wipro as their current workplace on their profile)\n\n### Founded\nN/A\n\n### Funding\nLast Round Date: N/A\nLast Round Type: N/A\nTotal Rounds: N/A\nLast Round Raised: N/A\n\n### Investors\nN/A","score":0.9108078},{"title":"Spirit of Wipro - Values That Drive Excellence and Integrity","url":"https://www.wipro.com/about-us","content":"#\n\nWipro is a leading Al-powered technology services and consulting company focused on building innovative solutions that address clients' most complex digital transformation needs.\n\nWipro at a glance.\n\n$10.50B\n\nAnnual Revenue as of financial year ended March 2026\n\n240K+\n\nEmployees\n\n65 Countries\n\nwith 146+ Nationalities\n\n80 years\n\nof progress & purpose\n\n25+ years\n\nlisted on NYSE\n\n66%\n\nEconomic interest vested in philanthropy\n\nWhat Drives Us.\n\nSPIRIT OF WIPRO","score":0.7971311},{"title":"News and Events - Wipro","url":"https://www.wipro.com/newsroom","content":"March 19, 2026\n\nGANDHINAGAR, India – March 19, 2026: Wipro Limited (NYSE: WIT, BSE: 507685, NSE: WIPRO), a leading AI-powered technology services and consulting company, today announced the...\n\nRead more\n\n#### Wipro and Harness Announce Strategic Collaboration to Accelerate AI-Native Software Delivery for Global Enterprises\n\nMarch 17, 2026 [...] February 04, 2026\n\nBENGALURU, India | CAMBRIDGE, Mass. – Feb. 04, 2026: Wipro Limited (NYSE: WIT, BSE: 507685, NSE: WIPRO), a leading AI-powered technology services and consulting company,...\n\nRead more\n\n#### Wipro earthian Awards 2025 Felicitate Excell