to Content](#accessContent)\n* [Skip to Navigation](#accessNavigation)\n* [Skip to Footer](#accessFooter)\n* [Skip to Cookie Settings](#onetrust-banner-sdk)\n\n[![Wipro Logo](/content/dam/wipro/social-icons/wipro_new_logo.svg)](/en/)\n\n[![Wipro IG](/content/dam/wipro/social-icons/instagram.svg)](https://www.instagram.com/wiprolimited)   [![Linkedin Wipro](/content/dam/wipro/social-icons/linkedin.svg)](https://www.linkedin.com/wiprolimited)\n\n#### Europe ›\n\nEurope Sub Menu Opened\n\n* Benelux   [en](/en-benelux/)\n* Europe   [en](/en-EU/)   |   [de](/de-EU/)\n* Germany & Austria   [en](/en-DE/)   |   [de](/de-DE/)\n* Nordic   [en](/en-nordic/)\n* Southern Europe   [en](/en-Southern-EU/)   |   [fr](/fr-Southern-EU/)\n* United Kingdom & Ireland   [en](/en-UKI/)\n\n#### Americas ›\n\nAmericas Sub Menu Opened\n\n* Brazil   [en](/en-BR/)   |   [pt](/pt-BR/)\n* Canada   [en](/en-CA/)   |   [fr](/fr-CA/)\n* Latam   [en](/en-latam/)\n* Mexico   [en](/en-MX/)   |   [es](/es-MX/)\n* United States   [en](/en-US/)\n\n#### Asia & Pacific ›\n\nAsia & Pacific Sub Menu Opened\n\n* Asean   [en](/en-asean/)\n* Australia & New Zealand   [en](/en-ANZ/)\n* China   [en](/en-CN/)\n* Japan   [ja](/ja-JP/)   |   [en](/en-JP/)\n* Korea   [en](/en-KR/)\n* Taiwan   [en](/en-TW/)\n\n#### India & Middle East ›\n\nIndia & Middle East Sub Menu Opened\n\n* India   [en](/en-IN/)\n* Middle East   [en](/en-ME/)\n\n[#### Africa](/en-africa/)\n\n[<](/leadership/) [Leadership](/leadership/)\n\nSrini Pallia | Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director\n\n![favorite page](/content/dam/nexus/images/scroll/comments.png)  ![unfavorite page](/content/dam/nexus/images/scroll/liked.png)  [![share icon](/content/dam/nexus/images/share-icons/share-icon.png)](javascript:void(0))\n\n![favorite page](/content/dam/nexus/images/scroll/comments.png)  ![unfavorite page](/content/dam/nexus/images/scroll/liked.png)\n\nX\n\n[![microsites_play_icon](/content/dam/nexus/images/share-icons/share-icon.png)](javascript:void(0))\n\n![popup-image]()\n\nSrini Palliais the Chief Executive Officer and Managing Director of Wipro Limited. In his role as the CEO, Srini sets the vision and strategy for Wipro’s business and leads a team of global leaders to drive consistent execution of Wipro’s AI-powered, consulting- led approach across six continents.\n\nSrini has a track record of building cross-functional, cross-regional teams that deliver on clients’ most complex business and digital transformation needs. His focus on client- centricity and ability to lead through major industry transformations have been instrumental in driving ongoing value for clients as well as consistent profitable growth for the businesses he has led.\n\nPrior to assuming the Global CEO role, Srini served as CEO of Wipro’s Americas 1 Strategic Market Unit (SMU), turning it into Wipro’s largest and fastest growing SMU. In his more than three decades at Wipro, Srini has held numerous leadership roles, including President of Wipro’s Consumer Business Unit and Global Head of Business Application Services.\n\nSrini holds a bachelor’s degree in engineering, and a master’s in management studies from Indian Institute of Science, Bangalore. He graduated from Harvard Business School’s Leading Global Businesses executive program, and the Advanced Leadership Program at McGill Executive Institute.\n\nAn avid hiker, Srini lives in New Jersey with his family.\n\nX\n\n![Share Icon](/content/dam/nexus/images/share-icons/share-icon.png)\n\n![popup-image]()\n\n## Contact Wipro\n\n### Please fill the required details to access the content\n\n![loading.gif](/content/dam/nexus/images/search/loading.gif)\n\n \n\"\"\"",{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"verdict":{"type":"string","format":"enum","enum":["supported","unsupported","contradicted"]},"evidenceQuote":{"type":"string"},"reasoning":{"type":"string"}},"required":["verdict","evidenceQuote","reasoning"]}}]}
