{"ts":"2026-09-26T17:42:33.196Z","session":"54fe0cb1-b317-4e7b-ab5b-6e712cf00bdc","event":"tool.end","callId":"99d23c98-6c68-4d16-afbd-b47600ea450d","name":"webSearch","duration_ms":1464,"result":[{"title":"Author Page | ME Insights","url":"https://www.manageengine.com/insights/author/shailesh","content":"Shailesh Kumar Davey is the co-founder and CEO of Zoho Corp. With over 25 years of experience in the industry, he has been instrumental in Zoho’s journey from a fledgling startup to a multi-product, multi-brand organization. Previously, as vice president of engineering at ManageEngine, a division of Zoho Corp., he spearheaded engineering initiatives and played a key role in developing the company's rapid application development tool. His work focused on network management frameworks and custom [...] Shailesh Davey\n\n# Shailesh Davey\n\nCo-founder & CEO of Zoho Corp, Zoho Corp. [...] and custom solutions for device vendors and OEM markets. Today, Shailesh devotes much of his time overseeing the three essentials of any SaaS organization—data, databases, and data centers—ensuring Zoho remains at the forefront of technological innovation and scalability.","score":0.878825},{"title":"We need to build our own AI solutions: Shailesh Davey, CEO, Zoho Corp | YourStory","url":"https://yourstory.com/2025/04/we-need-to-build-our-own-ai-solutions-zoho-corp-ceo-shailesh-davey","content":"For Shaliesh Davey, the newly-appointed CEO of ﻿Zoho Corporation﻿, building AI models is like running experiments–while some succeed, others don’t. The SaaS unicorn, which has embraced change, right from pivoting its original network management platform into a CRM solution decades ago, isn’t shying away from AI.\n\nDavey, who previously served as the Vice President of Engineering at ManageEngine, Zoho’s IT management arm, co-founded the firm in the mid-1990s. [...] With Zoho founder Sridhar Vembu now serving as the Chief Scientist, the company is focused on AI-driven automation, foundational models, and right-sized solutions for enterprises.\n\nIn an interview with YourStory, Davey discussed his leadership style, the company’s AI strategy, and its next big bet on indigenous foundational models.\n\nAlso Read\n\nAI is no longer a USP, it’s now fundamental to all tech: Zoho Corp’s ManageEngine CEO Rajesh Ganesan\n\nEdited excerpts from the interview: [...] Advertise with us\n\nWe need to build our own AI solutions: Shailesh Davey, CEO, Zoho Corp | YourStory","score":0.87782305},{"title":"Zoho’s New CEO, Same Grounded Playbook | Founding Fuel","url":"https://www.foundingfuel.com/article/zohos-new-ceo-same-grounded-playbook","content":"## A Steady Climb\n\nHis boss was the Vice President of Engineering, Shailesh Kumar Davey. Shailesh is now the group CEO of Zoho, having taken over the role from Sridhar Vembu this January. [...] Zoho’s New CEO, Same Grounded Playbook\n\nShailesh Davey, Zoho co-founder, succeeded Sridhar Vembu as CEO in January 2025\n\nIn 2001, shortly after joining Zoho (then AdventNet), Girish Mathrubootham, who would go on to found Freshworks, sat down with his new boss to chart out his early days in the role. Mathrubootham had only a broad understanding of the company and its goals. He knew little about its products, processes, or people. [...] Zoho's leadership transition to co-founder Shailesh Davey signals a renewed emphasis on its distinctive, \"hard knocks\" corporate culture. This approach, characterized by direct, ownership-driven learning and unwavering customer focus, has underpinned Zoho's impressive journey to over $1 billion in revenue. As the SaaS industry grapples with intense competition and the disruptive force of AI, Zoho's decade-long investment in artificial intelligence, deep engineering expertise, and frugal ethos","score":0.7992077},{"title":"Shailesh Kumar Davey Becomes Zoho's New CEO ...","url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DFXUkFvBa1l?hl=en","content":"Shailesh Kumar Davey Becomes Zoho's New CEO #ZohoLeadership #ShaileshKumarDavey #SridharVembu #AIInnovation #TechLeadership · January 28, 2025","score":0.6877354},{"title":"Shailesh Davey","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/in/shailesh-davey-281638","content":"is you and your skills. And the day came, gave the interview and ..passed it. Today it is my 8th year in Zoho Corporation . I want to thank Shibu Alexis (the senior employee) for all the knowledge and lessons and Zoho Corporation for allowing me to prove myself. And on the final note, It is never too late to start learning. [...] ## People Also Viewed\n- Devendra Burman (Accenture) - \n- Nikhil Goel (Armakuni) - \n- Gyanesh Sharma (DotPe) - \n- Shishir S. (Zoom) - \n- Rajeeva Gupta (Impetus) - \n- Sanjoy Singh (Tech Enterprise Business, Talentica Software) - \n- Vinayak Ganapuram (Crayon Data) - \n- Swaminathan Narayanan (Acalvio Technologies) - \n- Dinesh Kailash Kumar (Indian Institute of Management, Bangalore) - \n- Sujay Koduri (Building something new) - [...] - I have been going back and forth on deciding the company name, finally taking a poll. Please take a minute to pick your choice. Thanks in advance. #Startupshenanigans   \nShailesh Davey liked this  \nView Post  \nActivity Image","score":0.4342459}]}
